 to post your suggestions &amp;amp; helpful tips regarding the resorts, ceremony, reception, and\/or planning!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Has anyone found a timeline fitting for a sandals destination wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1803292,"PostDate":1380325317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey all! I'm getting married at Sandals Grande Riviera on March 28, 2015. Feel free to post your suggestions & helpful tips regarding the resorts, ceremony, reception, and\/or planning!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Has anyone found a timeline fitting for a sandals destination wedding?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tinasez2u@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380323372,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273826.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":119,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsLehman","Id":273826,"Name":"FutureMrsLehman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.210.10.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75206,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by whitney2103, 19 March 2014 - 06:07 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1395281248,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"adb4a8f4b13b31797346bd9e29bd4548","RawContent":"You&#039;ll have to post an update after your wedding experience.  We are getting married May 10, 2015 at Grande Riviera.","Attachments":[],"Id":1839367,"PostDate":1395281227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You'll have to post an update after your wedding experience.  We are getting married May 10, 2015 at Grande Riviera.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wjclark1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.210.10.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395280780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"whitney2103","Id":277243,"Name":"whitney2103","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.64.83.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75206,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dee1b633282eba94e1430001772dc162","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to BDW! Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839394,"PostDate":1395291608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome to BDW! Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.71.237.188","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75206,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3abffc8763b66c7db131bb2b847fcd10","RawContent":"We got married in December and our photographer was from The Memory Factory.  They specialize in destination weddings. Our pictures were gorgeous and he&#039;s very reasonable. We even used them for our welcome party. Email them for a quote at thememoryfactory@hotmail.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1851831,"PostDate":1400827868,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We got married in December and our photographer was from The Memory Factory.  They specialize in destination weddings. Our pictures were gorgeous and he's very reasonable. We even used them for our welcome party. Email them for a quote at thememoryfactory@hotmail.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joannaandwilson2013@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.71.237.188","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369788083,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270067.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":183,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoWil JoWil","Id":270067,"Name":"JoWil JoWil","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.127.69.41","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75206,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"977a957086352035a22096f55bf550bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married there May 30 and cannot wait!!!!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862810,"PostDate":1406574597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married there May 30 and cannot wait!!!!!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"randajo_06@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.127.71.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406021683,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"MarandaGilliland","Id":279119,"Name":"MarandaGilliland","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.248.147.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75206,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fc659844979913171d3b0496e31661b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsLehman\" post=\"1803292\" timestamp=\"1380321717\"]\nHey all! I&#039;m getting married at Sandals Grande Riviera on March 28, 2015. Feel free to post your suggestions &amp;amp; helpful tips regarding the resorts, ceremony, reception, and\/or planning!   Has anyone found a timeline fitting or a sandals destination wedding?[\/quote]\nI was wondering if you would let us know how your wedding day turned out? I&#039;m also getting married at Sandals Grande Riviera (May 17, 2015) and any suggestions - or warnings would be helpful.   It seems like the closer we get, the more I start to worry.  :)  Did you use their photographers? This is my biggest worry,  I&#039;ve heard so many different reviews on this!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892992,"PostDate":1428989670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsLehman, on 27 September 2013 - 03:41 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hey all! I'm getting married at Sandals Grande Riviera on March 28, 2015. Feel free to post your suggestions & helpful tips regarding the resorts, ceremony, reception, and\/or planning! \u00a0 Has anyone found a timeline fitting or a sandals destination wedding?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nI was wondering if you would let us know how your wedding day turned out? I'm also getting married at Sandals Grande Riviera (May 17, 2015) and any suggestions - or warnings would be helpful.   It seems like the closer we get, the more I start to worry.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  Did you use their photographers? This is my biggest worry,  I've heard so many different reviews on this!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenng004@aol.com","IpAddress":"172.248.147.49","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428985820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jenng004","Id":282734,"Name":"jenng004","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"75206","Title":"2015 Sandals Jamaica Brides Post Here!!","LastPostDate":1428989670},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
