]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Dymond6[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks, I have never heard of that store.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1466251,"PostDate":1307647118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Christmas Tree Shop is only in New England \"I think\" they may have a website? I'm not sure!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Dymond6<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks, I have never heard of that store.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sllefebvr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.223.108.246","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1298521181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237131.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sllefebvr","Id":237131,"Name":"Sllefebvr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b1095f9878e6ff494a7cce8f769371d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; what!!! I am so glad for this forum...tax you on your own items...I love this site. Are receipts sufficient evidence that you arent going to see in Jamaica?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1500253,"PostDate":1312615804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> what!!! I am so glad for this forum...tax you on your own items...I love this site. Are receipts sufficient evidence that you arent going to see in Jamaica?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"qweenace@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1285814588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232788.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BridetwoBe","Id":232788,"Name":"BridetwoBe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dea91305f362cda5e234cfeb1c88aa66","RawContent":"5 checked bags!  Yp thats so gonna be me!  lol  Good to know about the Rum... thanks for posting this info.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]dmob[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We didn&#039;t have any problems bringing first aide kits, snacks and wedding decorations through customs using a total of 5 checked bags. We didn&#039;t have any starfish, but we did have sand dollars. Hope this helps. Oh, leaving after the wedding, the bottles of rum that we purchased in Jamaica for the OOT bags diid not make it through customs![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1524949,"PostDate":1317007532,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> 5 checked bags!\u00a0 Yp thats so gonna be me!\u00a0 lol\u00a0 Good to know about the Rum... thanks for posting this info.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>dmob<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We didn't have any problems bringing first aide kits, snacks and wedding decorations through customs using a total of 5 checked bags. We didn't have any starfish, but we did have sand dollars. Hope this helps. Oh, leaving after the wedding, the bottles of rum that we purchased in Jamaica for the OOT bags diid not make it through customs!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zackberensonwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313529971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243980.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"zbwedding","Id":243980,"Name":"zbwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ce8dcbd9a642d2f68137fb514139988","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Dymond6[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I need to find starfish... where are you guys finding them?[\/quote] \n \n \n I need to find statfish too... I want to add them as a finishing touch to nmy ceremony fans... anyone have any suggestions?","Attachments":[],"Id":1524955,"PostDate":1317008041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Dymond6<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I need to find starfish... where are you guys finding them?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> I need to find statfish too... I want to add them as a finishing touch to nmy ceremony fans... anyone have any suggestions?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zackberensonwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313529971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243980.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"