:"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dymond6","Id":239364,"Name":"Dymond6","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f35d49a0362ad2d10c604ff5fd757512","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks for the tip re: receipts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1444095,"PostDate":1304265951,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks for the tip re: receipts.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinakleiner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303238194,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239044.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daizyduke","Id":239044,"Name":"daizyduke","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f0ddfef84923818d270c9d7db70d431","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; For receipts, are these receipts for things you are buying while down there? Or things you are bringing with you?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1444118,"PostDate":1304269791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> For receipts, are these receipts for things you are buying while down there? Or things you are bringing with you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristaelms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1287947811,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233457.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daisymable","Id":233457,"Name":"daisymable","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f16e55ac3324947e8db0f52d8a273b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Bring receipts for anything that you are bringing their with you.&amp;nbsp; If customs stops you they can put any price on the items and tax you based on that.&amp;nbsp; We had no problems, but have heard others in the past have.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1448052,"PostDate":1304817290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Bring receipts for anything that you are bringing their with you.\u00a0 If customs stops you they can put any price on the items and tax you based on that.\u00a0 We had no problems, but have heard others in the past have.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"importlovergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1272050475,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227588.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"futuremrswalls","Id":227588,"Name":"futuremrswalls","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4aa83d49f87fdb89c807731b2df1dea0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We just returned from Jamaica (RIU Ocho Rios) and had taken our own starfish down that I had purchased at Hobby Lobby.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We had no troubles at all.&amp;nbsp; I even carried&amp;nbsp;the large one&amp;nbsp;on the plane&amp;nbsp;with me while going to Jamaica and had checked it on the way home.&amp;nbsp; We also had several bottles of Appleton rum and Sangster rum cream that we checked in our luggage and brought home.&amp;nbsp; No issues what so ever.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1448124,"PostDate":1304826568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We just returned from Jamaica (RIU Ocho Rios) and had taken our own starfish down that I had purchased at Hobby Lobby.\u00a0<\/p> <p> We had no troubles at all.\u00a0 I even carried\u00a0the large one\u00a0on the plane\u00a0with me while going to Jamaica and had checked it on the way home.\u00a0 We also had several bottles of Appleton rum and Sangster rum cream that we checked in our luggage and brought home.\u00a0 No issues what so ever.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><i>Theresa<\/i><\/strong><br><strong><i>Riu Ocho Rios April 16, 2011<\/i><\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;0\/st\/20110416\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/15e8\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...15e8\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"thutch_us@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1263523192,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224690.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hutchets","Id":224690,"Name":"hutchets","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59165,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"155957312b29e5386161bfeac8fcf499","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Dymond6[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I need to find starfish... where are you guys finding them?[\/quote] \n \n \n I just bought my starfish from the Christmas Tree Shop! A Pack of 6 for $1.99.. Geesh!! I love that store! They have sand dollars, small starfish and large star fish!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1464135,"PostDate":1307370056,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Dymond6<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I need to find starfish... where are you guys finding them?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> I just bought my starfish from the Christmas Tree Shop! A Pack of 6 for $1.99.. Geesh!! I love that store! They have sand dollars, small starfish and large star fish!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sllefebvr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.223.108.246","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1298521181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237131.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sllefebvr","Id":237131,"Name":"Sllefebvr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,