people there and maybe asking a few to come, but with arriving on Saturday, wedding on Monday, I don&#039;t think there will be much time to make friends!","Attachments":[],"Id":1769977,"PostDate":1371601675,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Does anyone know if Sandals provides witnesses for you if you are eloping? This thought just literally popped into my head haha. I was planning on meeting people there and maybe asking a few to come, but with arriving on Saturday, wedding on Monday, I don't think there will be much time to make friends!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369834006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.93.242.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ba1450d6c2e92f7a540616598026546","RawContent":"[quote name=\"redsoxgrl\" post=\"1769977\" timestamp=\"1371598075\"]\nDoes anyone know if Sandals provides witnesses for you if you are eloping? This thought just literally popped into my head haha. I was planning on meeting people there and maybe asking a few to come, but with arriving on Saturday, wedding on Monday, I don&#039;t think there will be much time to make friends![\/quote]\nWhat days will you be there?  We are also getting married July 2014 at Sandals Negril.  Not a big wedding at all, just eloping :-)  I don&#039;t see too many people doing just a private wedding, it&#039;s all bigger weddings I am reading about.","Attachments":[],"Id":1833464,"PostDate":1392264254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>redsoxgrl, on 18 June 2013 - 04:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Does anyone know if Sandals provides witnesses for you if you are eloping? This thought just literally popped into my head haha. I was planning on meeting people there and maybe asking a few to come, but with arriving on Saturday, wedding on Monday, I don't think there will be much time to make friends!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What days will you be there?\u00a0 We are also getting married July 2014 at Sandals Negril.\u00a0 Not a big wedding at all, just eloping :-)\u00a0 I don't see too many people doing just a private wedding, it's all bigger weddings I am reading about.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"austynrj79@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.93.242.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390094354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276187.jpg?_r=1401839430","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KHall79","Id":276187,"Name":"KHall79","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"359b282604e28cf4483cc1aa5e5d2428","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KHall79\" post=\"1833464\" timestamp=\"1392260654\"]\nWhat days will you be there?  We are also getting married July 2014 at Sandals Negril.  Not a big wedding at all, just eloping :-)  I don&#039;t see too many people doing just a private wedding, it&#039;s all bigger weddings I am reading about.[\/quote]\nWe will be there July 26-Aug 2nd!","Attachments":[],"Id":1833468,"PostDate":1392264706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KHall79, on 12 February 2014 - 08:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>What days will you be there?  We are also getting married July 2014 at Sandals Negril.  Not a big wedding at all, just eloping :-)  I don't see too many people doing just a private wedding, it's all bigger weddings I am reading about.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe will be there July 26-Aug 2nd! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369834006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.190.197.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"956c0c5428bf031b9c018c839c4d5b08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Was it hard to make the decision to get married in a resort that was adults only ? I know that I have some friend that have young kids&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847779,"PostDate":1398944317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Was it hard to make the decision to get married in a resort that was adults only ? I know that I have some friend that have young kids<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danellepellebon@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.190.197.95","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1210206405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209293.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DelightfulDani","Id":209293,"Name":"DelightfulDani","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.93.242.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ea36b0c51cbb72b34d7fb4ad274a432","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Anyone have any experience with the hair &amp;amp; Make-up done on site at SN?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m in limbo about what to do!&amp;nbsp; Just do my own? or shell out the cash and hope for the best?&amp;nbsp; I haven&#039;t seen any reviews on this.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853742,"PostDate":1401854142,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Anyone have any experience with the hair & Make-up done on site at SN?\u00a0 I'm in limbo about what to do!\u00a0 Just do my own? or shell out the cash and hope for the best?\u00a0 I haven't seen any reviews on this.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"austynrj79@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.93.242.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390094354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276187.jpg?_r=1401839430","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KHall79","Id":276187,"Name":"KHall79","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe760753ffbacac4cafed22fc9a93e88","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KHall79\" post=\"1853742\" timestamp=\"1401850542\"]\nAnyone have any experience with the hair &amp;amp; Make-up done on site at SN?  I&#039;m in limbo about what to do!  Just do my own? or shell out the cash and hope for the best?  I haven&#039;t seen any reviews on this.[\/quote]\nWhen is your wedding? I booked hair\/makeup trial and day of at the spa. I can report back with a review. My wedding is end of July :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1854235,"PostDate":1402142941,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KHall79, on 03 June 2014 - 07:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Anyone have any experience with the hair & Make-up done on site at SN?  I'm in limbo about what to do!  Just do my own? or shell out the cash and hope for the best?  I haven't seen any reviews on this.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWhen is your wedding? I booked hair\/makeup trial and day of at the spa. I can report back with a review. My wedding is end of July <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369834006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"110.173.54.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a10aefade18aeb8729d22a3adacd779d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think the bride&#039;s &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.eozy.com\/shoes&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;shoes&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; are hard to find.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855418,"PostDate":1402906173,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think the bride's <a href='http:\/\/www.eozy.com\/shoes' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong>shoes<\/strong><\/a> are hard to find.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nfaih97659@gmail.com","IpAddress":"119.42.149.226","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402303838,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nvjagapo","Id":278335,"Name":"nvjagapo","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"61123","Title":"Sandals Negril Weddings","LastPostDate":1402906173},"Pages":{"TotalItems":97,"TotalPages":