> User Toyal (284663)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3635b414538231e725c76601692adb99","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am getting married at Sandals Negril on April 21, 2012 at 4pm.&amp;nbsp; So far we are doing the Flutter of Romance package with the ceromony on the beach.&amp;nbsp; We did book the on site photographer and are only doing the 30 minute reception...but I am considering extending it.&amp;nbsp;Any suggestions??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591739,"PostDate":1331162480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am getting married at Sandals Negril on April 21, 2012 at 4pm.\u00a0 So far we are doing the Flutter of Romance package with the ceromony on the beach.\u00a0 We did book the on site photographer and are only doing the 30 minute reception...but I am considering extending it.\u00a0Any suggestions??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelle_kerosky@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331160321,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMClark","Id":252437,"Name":"FutureMClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3384a50d3958f68cdce363aa6111701","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are planning on marrying at Sandals Negril in November 2012. I&#039;m so glad I found this thread can&#039;t wait to read all about your experiences! We are having a private wedding probably just the 2 of us possibly another couple but we really want a nice private ceremony and we will have a reception when we get back with all the pics and experience we had! My only concerns is how well the hair and make-up and photos turn out! I would just like any recommendations on a photographer and one that has nice ideas for special poses! I will keep watching this thread to see any pics and reviews from others who get married there!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596920,"PostDate":1332253588,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are planning on marrying at Sandals Negril in November 2012. I'm so glad I found this thread can't wait to read all about your experiences! We are having a private wedding probably just the 2 of us possibly another couple but we really want a nice private ceremony and we will have a reception when we get back with all the pics and experience we had! My only concerns is how well the hair and make-up and photos turn out! I would just like any recommendations on a photographer and one that has nice ideas for special poses! I will keep watching this thread to see any pics and reviews from others who get married there!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maisy_hero@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232741651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214236.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"maisy","Id":214236,"Name":"maisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8f9397b7a44abc5af0801d61db9204b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I know most of you have already had your wedding by now and I&#039;m hoping you might have some advice....We are getting married at Sandals Negril in April 12, 2013. I am finding a lot of hidden costs....any advice or suggestions would be greatly apprciated.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We would like to get married on the beach.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thinking about having the reception just for the wedding party and parents. Then have the private 2 hours dinner.&amp;nbsp; Pay for 1 hour DJ and 1 hour steel drum band.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I really just don&#039;t understand how it all works and the coordinator is very hard to get answers from.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks in advance :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1612938,"PostDate":1335569052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I know most of you have already had your wedding by now and I'm hoping you might have some advice....We are getting married at Sandals Negril in April 12, 2013. I am finding a lot of hidden costs....any advice or suggestions would be greatly apprciated.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We would like to get married on the beach.<\/p> <p> Thinking about having the reception just for the wedding party and parents. Then have the private 2 hours dinner.\u00a0 Pay for 1 hour DJ and 1 hour steel drum band.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I really just don't understand how it all works and the coordinator is very hard to get answers from.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks in advance <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candaceloucks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328908287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251249.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Candace Mark","Id":251249,"Name":"Candace Mark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f349b9e67b75ae219cb269f40aeb840a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just got married at Sandals Negril on April 21st and they did an absolute FABULOUS job!!!!! I can message you pictures if you want.&amp;nbsp; Duwayne was our wedding captain and Charmaine was the wedding co-ordinator.&amp;nbsp; We did the Flutter of Romance theme and got married on the beach.&amp;nbsp; We did a 1-hour cocktail reception with a DJ and I used the photographer from Sandals and also had my hair and make-up done onsite.&amp;nbsp; Our only issue was the rehersal dinner, the servers were extremly rude and half my guest never got their food.&amp;nbsp; I complained to the wedding captain and they were all over it, apologized and handled.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1613706,"PostDate":1335799522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just got married at Sandals Negril on April 21st and they did an absolute FABULOUS job!!!!! I can message you pictures if you want.\u00a0 Duwayne was our wedding captain and Charmaine was the wedding co-ordinator.\u00a0 We did the Flutter of Romance theme and got married on the beach.\u00a0 We did a 1-hour cocktail reception with a DJ and I used the photographer from Sandals and also had my hair and make-up done onsite.\u00a0 Our only issue was the rehersal dinner, the servers were extremly rude and half my guest never got their food.\u00a0 I complained to the wedding captain and they were all over it, apologized and handled.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelle_kerosky@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331160321,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMClark","Id":252437,"Name":"FutureMClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d6591da7654082b949f9d90d3d6b1bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations! I am so happy that you had an amazing experience. I would love to see pictures. Would you mind messaging them to me? I can not wait to hear more.&amp;nbsp; How did you find the Wedding Planners before you arrived? Did you by chance sign a rooms contract? Sorry for all the questions. It is just amazing to have someone that&#039;s been there.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are thinking about doing the beach wedding and then have the private reception and dinner.&amp;nbsp; Did you do the reception on the beach as well?&amp;nbsp;We would like to have a steel drum band for the reception&amp;nbsp;and the DJ for after&amp;nbsp;dinner.&amp;nbsp;How did you find the food and cake?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for writing back to me :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1615097,"PostDate":1336003793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations! I am so happy that you had an amazing experience. I would love to see pictures. Would you mind messaging them to me? I can not wait to hear more.\u00a0 How did you find the Wedding Planners before you arrived? Did you by chance sign a rooms contract? Sorry for all the questions. It is just amazing to have someone that's been there.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are thinking about doing the beach wedding and then have the private reception and dinner.\u00a0 Did you do the reception on the beach as well?\u00a0We would like to have a steel drum band for the reception\u00a0and the DJ for after\u00a0dinner.\u00a0How did you find the food and cake?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for writing back to me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candaceloucks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328908287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251249.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Candace Mark","Id":251249,"Name":"Candace Mark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c210704c8a421ec4291cecd97480c4cb","RawContent":"Hi Brides I&#039;m trying to decide on which Sandals Jamaican resort to use for my weddingmoon. It will be only my FH and I. I&#039;d love a beach wedding, can anyone inform me on any hidden fees? Do you recommend booking the flight separate, will it be cheaper? If anyone has pics can you send them to me? Right now I&#039;m thinking of the twilight wedding, has anyone done one, how were the pics? Can anyone tell me if they have used the web stream option and do you have to purchase the video package and Add this streaming video afterwards?","Attachments":[],"Id":1622339,"PostDate":1337615872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Brides I'm trying to decide on which Sandals Jamaican resort to use for my weddingmoon. It will be only my FH and I. I'd love a beach wedding, can anyone inform me on any hidden fees? Do you recommend booking the flight separate, will it be cheaper? If anyone has pics can you send them to me? Right now I'm thinking of the twilight wedding, has anyone done one, how were the pics? Can anyone tell me if they have used the web stream option and do you have to purchase the video package and Add this streaming video afterwards?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Flanders.sophia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1337615407,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255621.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsAllen","Id":255621,"Name":"MrsAllen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b4a5c5b442c55d01465808b613715d9","RawContent":"I am getting married at Sandals Negril in November. Could you send me some wedding pics from your wedding? I understand you have to use the Sandals photographer only and the packages are pricey so I would love to know how you felt the photographer and photos were? A few other questions..We are staying at the Grand Lux beachfront rooms, do they give you a special Honeymoon room the night of your wedding or no? Was there a lot mire hidden costs that surprised you or was it pretty much what they quoted you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1634104,"PostDate":1340379038,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married at Sandals Negril in November. Could you send me some wedding pics from your wedding? I understand you have to use the Sandals photographer only and the packages are pricey so I would love to know how you felt the photographer and photos were? A few other questions..We are staying at the Grand Lux beachfront rooms, do they give you a special Honeymoon room the night of your wedding or no? Was there a lot mire hidden costs that surprised you or was it pretty much what they quoted you?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maisy_hero@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232741651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214236.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"maisy","Id":214236,"Name":"maisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eddebe39cb404967f46872be27b23068","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I will be getting married there May 13, 2013 &amp;amp; am very excited but not sure what to expect because I cannot find a lot of reviews on weddings here... anyone have any reviews they have been to or anyone who has been .. any advice?? Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1642441,"PostDate":1342568576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I will be getting married there May 13, 2013 & am very excited but not sure what to expect because I cannot find a lot of reviews on weddings here... anyone have any reviews they have been to or anyone who has been .. any advice?? Thank you!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pamelajeanrdh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342568133,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257994.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelajeanrdh","Id":257994,"Name":"pamelajeanrdh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c2cd416c0e2156353d50987b89f0125","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I see that you photographed a wedding at Sandals Negril. I thought outside vendors are prohibited?? How did you get around this as I&#039;d like to bring my own photographer as well because their photo packages are outrageous!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644142,"PostDate":1343017740,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I see that you photographed a wedding at Sandals Negril. I thought outside vendors are prohibited?? How did you get around this as I'd like to bring my own photographer as well because their photo packages are outrageous!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mariafoster123@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342839461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258123.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"flipper7622","Id":258123,"Name":"flipper7622","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d02e2af57df7b5b59904297b694d6d26","RawContent":"[quote name=\"flipper7622\"]\nI see that you photographed a wedding at Sandals Negril. I thought outside vendors are prohibited?? How did you get around this as I&#039;d like to bring my own photographer as well because their photo packages are outrageous![\/quote] In my experience, I always stay at the resort for 3 nights some am a guest and have never had a problem with couples paying fees","Attachments":[],"Id":1645083,"PostDate":1343225293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"flipper7622\" url=\"\/t\/73054\/sandals&#045;negril&#045;weddings\/40#post_1793710\"><p>I see that you photographed a wedding at Sandals Negril. I thought outside vendors are prohibited?? How did you get around this as I'd like to bring my own photographer as well because their photo packages are outrageous!<\/p><\/blockquote> In my experience, I always stay at the resort for 3 nights some am a guest and have never had a problem with couples paying fees\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@kristilavoiephotography.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1338329469,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255989.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KLPhoto","Id":255989,"Name":"KLPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":97,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
