{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.197.185.170","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfb912606777ececb33d75a4c5a9af26","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bee\" post=\"1834338\" timestamp=\"1392723810\"]\nHi there! New to this and the forum. Glad to find others inquiring about the RWS. Getting married there December 2014. Will follow this thread for any info or pics of the venue. Thanks![\/quote]Hi Bee, \n\nI am getting married there in Dec 2014 as well.. which date did you secure, what a coincidence.... =)","Attachments":[],"Id":1834435,"PostDate":1392757637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bee, on 18 February 2014 - 04:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi there! New to this and the forum. Glad to find others inquiring about the RWS. Getting married there December 2014. Will follow this thread for any info or pics of the venue. Thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Bee,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married there in Dec 2014 as well.. which date did you secure, what a coincidence.... =)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pollyt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.197.185.168","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1390377255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dec2014star","Id":276258,"Name":"dec2014star","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8424f884f0ba689e341495a4ceadeed3","RawContent":"So exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1834437,"PostDate":1392758049,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"balbrach@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392727144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Bee","Id":276758,"Name":"Bee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d96e3295cafe87c334442951afe4b642","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dec2014star\" post=\"1834435\" timestamp=\"1392754037\"]\nHi Bee, \n\nI am getting married there in Dec 2014 as well.. which date did you secure, what a coincidence.... =)[\/quote]So exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1834446,"PostDate":1392761290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dec2014star, on 18 February 2014 - 01:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Bee,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married there in Dec 2014 as well.. which date did you secure, what a coincidence.... =)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>So exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"balbrach@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392727144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Bee","Id":276758,"Name":"Bee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a06b4a4e1c46a6165b600208633aa69b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1829185\" timestamp=\"1390861443\"]\nHello future brides!! I&#039;ve been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.\n\nNOW, we are ready! And I&#039;m super duper excited to get started!!\n\nWe always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...\n\nI came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.\n\nWell, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! :)\n\nAnyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can&#039;t find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!\n\nHappy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!\n\nPam :) xo[\/quote]Hi Pam! Congrats on booking your date. I&#039;m a month after you at the RWS. I&#039;ve got all the documents you uploaded from the resort as well. Hoping this thread will be helpful to other brides planning a wedding at this new resort! Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1834466,"PostDate":1392767761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 27 January 2014 - 03:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello future brides!! I've been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>NOW, we are ready! And I'm super duper excited to get started!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can't find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> xo<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Pam! Congrats on booking your date. I'm a month after you at the RWS. I've got all the documents you uploaded from the resort as well. Hoping this thread will be helpful to other brides planning a wedding at this new resort! Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"balbrach@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392727144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Bee","Id":276758,"Name":"Bee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"879bb89d974f7b274a72e6c7df88015e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bee\" post=\"1834466\" timestamp=\"1392764161\"]\nHi Pam! Congrats on booking your date. I&#039;m a month after you at the RWS. I&#039;ve got all the documents you uploaded from the resort as well. Hoping this thread will be helpful to other brides planning a wedding at this new resort! Good luck![\/quote]Hi Bee! Congrats on your wedding and setting your date! I&#039;m November 17th - couldn&#039;t be more excited and feeling very happy! :D\n\nWe&#039;ll have to keep in touch over the coming months on anything that would help us in regards to the resort! Polly (dec2014star above) is also getting married in December - lucky ladies! So close together!\n\nI promise to answer all your questions if you have any once I return November 23rd!\n\nHappy planning! ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1834639,"PostDate":1392845396,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bee, on 18 February 2014 - 03:56 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Pam! Congrats on booking your date. I'm a month after you at the RWS. I've got all the documents you uploaded from the resort as well. Hoping this thread will be helpful to other brides planning a wedding at this new resort! Good luck!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Bee! Congrats on your wedding and setting your date! I'm November 17th - couldn't be more excited and feeling very happy! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll have to keep in touch over the coming months on anything that would help us in regards to the resort! Polly (dec2014star above) is also getting married in December - lucky ladies! So close together!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I promise to answer all your questions if you have any once I return November 23rd!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e8e937b3b13d54111b0833310e0656a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1834639\" timestamp=\"1392841796\"]\nHi Bee! Congrats on your wedding and setting your date! I&#039;m November 17th - couldn&#039;t be more excited and feeling very happy! :D\n\nWe&#039;ll have to keep in touch over the coming months on anything that would help us in regards to the resort! Polly (dec2014star above) is also getting married in December - lucky ladies! So close together!\n\nI promise to answer all your questions if you have any once I return November 23rd!\n\nHappy planning! ;)[\/quote]Thanks! Hopefully we&#039;ll all know what to expect by the fall!","Attachments":[],"Id":1834712,"PostDate":1392883121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 19 February 2014 - 01:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Bee! Congrats on your wedding and setting your date! I'm November 17th - couldn't be more excited and feeling very happy! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll have to keep in touch over the coming months on anything that would help us in regards to the resort! Polly (dec2014star above) is also getting married in December - lucky ladies! So close together!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I promise to answer all your questions if you have any once I return November 23rd!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks! Hopefully we'll all know what to expect by the fall!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"balbrach@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.157.138.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392727144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Bee","Id":276758,"Name":"Bee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.117.78.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68dea58d79b5efa61e8b63fe14d75e30","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So happy I came across this site. I&#039;m also getting married at the Royalton. Oct 2nd &#039;14.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"pamelas21\"] Can you send me the picture of the locations as well. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:laylamonet7@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;laylamonet7@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; Thanks a bunch!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835181,"PostDate":1393121128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So happy I came across this site. I'm also getting married at the Royalton. Oct 2nd '14.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a> Can you send me the picture of the locations as well. <a href='mailto:laylamonet7@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>laylamonet7@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>\u00a0 Thanks a bunch!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laylamonet7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.117.78.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393120634,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Laylamonet7","Id":276827,"Name":"Laylamonet7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58be324e10a1bbee1ac2c1f0fd9a6b7a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Laylamonet7\" post=\"1835181\" timestamp=\"1393117528\"]\nSo happy I came across this site. I&#039;m also getting married at the Royalton. Oct 2nd &#039;14.\n\n@[member=\"pamelas21\"] Can you send me the picture of the locations as well. [email=\"laylamonet7@%5Bmember=\"]laylamonet7@[member=\"gmail\"].com[\/email]  Thanks a bunch![\/quote]\nJust sent it to your email address!\n\nPam :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1835431,"PostDate":1393278701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Laylamonet7, on 22 February 2014 - 06:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So happy I came across this site. I'm also getting married at the Royalton. Oct 2nd '14.<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a> Can you send me the picture of the locations as well. <a href='mailto:laylamonet7@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>laylamonet7@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>\u00a0 Thanks a bunch!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just sent it to your email address!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.212.7.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d00c9a8b0c3eb11e78e19ad6e03fdb74","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bee\" post=\"1834446\" timestamp=\"1392757690\"]\nSo exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you?[\/quote]Hi Bee, \n\nWe are Dec 5th...\n\nWe are arriving dec 2-9\n\nPolly","Attachments":[],"Id":1835487,"PostDate":1393325326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bee, on 18 February 2014 - 02:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Bee,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are Dec 5th...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are arriving dec 2-9<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Polly<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pollyt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.197.185.168","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1390377255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dec2014star","Id":276258,"Name":"dec2014star","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1ec24417955bd186af27854be343e37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know what is close to this resort in terms fo things to do? Just curious. Looking online it looks like it&#039;s sort of off by itself. Bars or shopping close by? Whoever has photos or anything else, I would take a look. We were married in Jamaica and thinking of a vow renewal next year in Mexico, but when I looked at this resort, it&#039;s absolutely gorgeous. I don&#039;t need to make a final decision yet - I have a long time to go and things to get through first before we can finalize, but this resort looks fabulous!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835542,"PostDate":1393351733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone know what is close to this resort in terms fo things to do? Just curious. Looking online it looks like it's sort of off by itself. Bars or shopping close by? Whoever has photos or anything else, I would take a look. We were married in Jamaica and thinking of a vow renewal next year in Mexico, but when I looked at this resort, it's absolutely gorgeous. I don't need to make a final decision yet - I have a long time to go and things to get through first before we can finalize, but this resort looks fabulous!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":358,"TotalPages":36,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
