> User Toyal (284663)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0d0257957a4ced2c702e9542edd775e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848397\" timestamp=\"1399384205\"]\nHi pamelas21!\n\nI am from Canada :) Where are you from?[\/quote]\nI&#039;m from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!\n\nWe have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!\n\nSo excited for you! How many people are you expecting?\n\nPam","Attachments":[],"Id":1848406,"PostDate":1399389401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 06 May 2014 - 06:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi pamelas21!<br><br>\nI am from Canada <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Where are you from?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited for you! How many people are you expecting?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7059c775df6f4fbcbc48df91dcee09f3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848406\" timestamp=\"1399385801\"]\nI&#039;m from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!\n \nWe have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!\n \nSo excited for you! How many people are you expecting?\n \nPam[\/quote]Wow! 51 booked already! That&#039;s great! We are planning a small wedding immediate family and our closest friends. We have 30 on our invite list and are expecting 20 or so to book. I&#039;m so excited. Choosing the resort was so stressful, I&#039;ve spent the last 3 weeks searching forums, reading reviews etc. I really hope the Royalton has space for our wedding. Hoping to get a response today sometime. (We are also booking with Sunwing :)\n\nWe are from Northern Ontario (just outside Sudbury). \n\nDo you mind sending me the information you received fm the resort? I believe I have most of it but I&#039;m not positive. They sent me the wedding packages, and the list of \"extras\" including flowers and photography.\n[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848406\" timestamp=\"1399385801\"]\nI&#039;m from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!\n \nWe have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!\n \nSo excited for you! How many people are you expecting?\n \nPam[\/quote]Email is falontubman@hotmail.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1848417,"PostDate":1399392462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 06 May 2014 - 07:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSo excited for you! How many people are you expecting?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nPam<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWow! 51 booked already! That's great! We are planning a small wedding immediate family and our closest friends. We have 30 on our invite list and are expecting 20 or so to book. I'm so excited. Choosing the resort was so stressful, I've spent the last 3 weeks searching forums, reading reviews etc. I really hope the Royalton has space for our wedding. Hoping to get a response today sometime. (We are also booking with Sunwing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nWe are from Northern Ontario (just outside Sudbury). <br><br>\nDo you mind sending me the information you received fm the resort? I believe I have most of it but I'm not positive. They sent me the wedding packages, and the list of \"extras\" including flowers and photography.<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 06 May 2014 - 07:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSo excited for you! How many people are you expecting?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nPam<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nEmail is falontubman@hotmail.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399395743,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9f070be16ae952a2b2d5c2c54df27b3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848417\" timestamp=\"1399388862\"]\nWow! 51 booked already! That&#039;s great! We are planning a small wedding immediate family and our closest friends. We have 30 on our invite list and are expecting 20 or so to book. I&#039;m so excited. Choosing the resort was so stressful, I&#039;ve spent the last 3 weeks searching forums, reading reviews etc. I really hope the Royalton has space for our wedding. Hoping to get a response today sometime. (We are also booking with Sunwing :)\n\nWe are from Northern Ontario (just outside Sudbury).\n\nDo you mind sending me the information you received fm the resort? I believe I have most of it but I&#039;m not positive. They sent me the wedding packages, and the list of \"extras\" including flowers and photography.\n\nEmail is falontubman@hotmail.com[\/quote]\nJust emailed it! :)\n\nGood luck with planning!\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------\n\nHello brides to be!\n\nSo I thought I would post what recently happened to my wedding date at the Royalton White Sands! [b]Because it\u2019s recently been changed![\/b]\n\nWe were originally scheduled for Monday, November 17[sup]th[\/sup] ceremony and reception on the beach MONTHS AGO! Contract signed, deposit in, STD\u2019s sent out, website up and everything!\n\nBUT\u2026..\n\nMy fianc\u00e9 was reading reviews on TA and he saw that the Royalton had a beach party on Mondays\u2026.\n\nHe mentioned it to me and I was like \u201c No way, they\u2019ll probably move it to Tuesday if they have a wedding on the beach on Monday like ours\u2026\u201d\n\nI dismissed and dismissed it \u2013 he kept bugging me to confirm with the wedding planner so FINALLY I did\u2026.and guess what?!\n\nThey don\u2019t move it!\n\nAt first she suggested we move it to pool side BUT Chris and I met on the beach literally in Cuba! And he proposed in Punta Cana\u2026.we love the Caribbean and we want to get married with our feet in the sand just as we met! &amp;lt;3\n\nI freaked out at first! Chris too!\n\nSo the wedding planner offered another option! On one side of the beach will be the beach party and on the other side of the beach our ceremony and reception\u2026.\n\nAt first we considered it but then I remembered that the beach at the Royalton is only 85 yards across! Now ladies I don\u2019t know what distance that is LOL so my fianc\u00e9 showed me! He was like from here to that house! LOL and it wasn\u2019t far at all\u2026..\n\nAnyways, I\u2019m writing a novel!\n\nTo keep it short! We\u2019ve now moved our date to Tuesday, November 18[sup]th[\/sup], 2014.\n\nSUCKS! But what can you do\u2026..\n\nGuess just wanted to post on here [u][b]NOT [\/b][\/u]to book your wedding on a [u][b]Monday [\/b][\/u]if you want it on the beach!\n\nGood luck ladies!\n\nXoxoxox Pam","Attachments":[],"Id":1848441,"PostDate":1399395703,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 06 May 2014 - 08:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow! 51 booked already! That's great! We are planning a small wedding immediate family and our closest friends. We have 30 on our invite list and are expecting 20 or so to book. I'm so excited. Choosing the resort was so stressful, I've spent the last 3 weeks searching forums, reading reviews etc. I really hope the Royalton has space for our wedding. Hoping to get a response today sometime. (We are also booking with Sunwing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nWe are from Northern Ontario (just outside Sudbury).<br><br>\nDo you mind sending me the information you received fm the resort? I believe I have most of it but I'm not positive. They sent me the wedding packages, and the list of \"extras\" including flowers and photography.<br><br>\nEmail is falontubman@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just emailed it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck with planning!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>---------------------------------------------------------------<\/p>\n<br><p>Hello brides to be!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I thought I would post what recently happened to my wedding date at the Royalton White Sands! <strong>Because it\u2019s recently been changed!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We were originally scheduled for Monday, November 17<sup>th<\/sup> ceremony and reception on the beach MONTHS AGO! Contract signed, deposit in, STD\u2019s sent out, website up and everything!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>BUT\u2026..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fianc\u00e9 was reading reviews on TA and he saw that the Royalton had a beach party on Mondays\u2026.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>He mentioned it to me and I was like \u201c No way, they\u2019ll probably move it to Tuesday if they have a wedding on the beach on Monday like ours\u2026\u201d<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I dismissed and dismissed it \u2013 he kept bugging me to confirm with the wedding planner so FINALLY I did\u2026.and guess what?!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They don\u2019t move it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At first she suggested we move it to pool side BUT Chris and I met on the beach literally in Cuba! And he proposed in Punta Cana\u2026.we love the Caribbean and we want to get married with our feet in the sand just as we met! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I freaked out at first! Chris too!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So the wedding planner offered another option! On one side of the beach will be the beach party and on the other side of the beach our ceremony and reception\u2026.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At first we considered it but then I remembered that the beach at the Royalton is only 85 yards across! Now ladies I don\u2019t know what distance that is LOL so my fianc\u00e9 showed me! He was like from here to that house! LOL and it wasn\u2019t far at all\u2026..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, I\u2019m writing a novel!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To keep it short! We\u2019ve now moved our date to Tuesday, November 18<sup>th<\/sup>, 2014.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>SUCKS! But what can you do\u2026..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Guess just wanted to post on here <u><strong>NOT <\/strong><\/u>to book your wedding on a <u><strong>Monday <\/strong><\/u>if you want it on the beach!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Xoxoxox Pam<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c6009327086c68d7ab58c901df9f0ec","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848441\" timestamp=\"1399392103\"]\nJust emailed it! :)\n \nGood luck with planning!\n \n---------------------------------------------------------------\nHello brides to be!\n \nSo I thought I would post what recently happened to my wedding date at the Royalton White Sands! [b]Because it\u2019s recently been changed![\/b]\n \nWe were originally scheduled for Monday, November 17[sup]th[\/sup] ceremony and reception on the beach MONTHS AGO! Contract signed, deposit in, STD\u2019s sent out, website up and everything!\n \nBUT\u2026..\n \nMy fianc\u00e9 was reading reviews on TA and he saw that the Royalton had a beach party on Mondays\u2026.\n \nHe mentioned it to me and I was like \u201c No way, they\u2019ll probably move it to Tuesday if they have a wedding on the beach on Monday like ours\u2026\u201d\n \nI dismissed and dismissed it \u2013 he kept bugging me to confirm with the wedding planner so FINALLY I did\u2026.and guess what?!\n \nThey don\u2019t move it!\n \nAt first she suggested we move it to pool side BUT Chris and I met on the beach literally in Cuba! And he proposed in Punta Cana\u2026.we love the Caribbean and we want to get married with our feet in the sand just as we met! &amp;lt;3\n \nI freaked out at first! Chris too!\n \nSo the wedding planner offered another option! On one side of the beach will be the beach party and on the other side of the beach our ceremony and reception\u2026.\n \nAt first we considered it but then I remembered that the beach at the Royalton is only 85 yards across! Now ladies I don\u2019t know what distance that is LOL so my fianc\u00e9 showed me! He was like from here to that house! LOL and it wasn\u2019t far at all\u2026..\n \nAnyways, I\u2019m writing a novel!\n \nTo keep it short! We\u2019ve now moved our date to Tuesday, November 18[sup]th[\/sup], 2014.\n \nSUCKS! But what can you do\u2026..\n \nGuess just wanted to post on here [b]NOT [\/b]to book your wedding on a [b]Monday [\/b]if you want it on the beach!\n \nGood luck ladies!\n \nXoxoxox Pam[\/quote]\nWow! This is very good to know! And thank you so much for the email, it is very helpful.","Attachments":[],"Id":1848444,"PostDate":1399396178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 06 May 2014 - 09:01 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Just emailed it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nGood luck with planning!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n---------------------------------------------------------------<br>\nHello brides to be!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSo I thought I would post what recently happened to my wedding date at the Royalton White Sands! <strong>Because it\u2019s recently been changed!<\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe were originally scheduled for Monday, November 17<sup>th<\/sup> ceremony and reception on the beach MONTHS AGO! Contract signed, deposit in, STD\u2019s sent out, website up and everything!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nBUT\u2026..<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nMy fianc\u00e9 was reading reviews on TA and he saw that the Royalton had a beach party on Mondays\u2026.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHe mentioned it to me and I was like \u201c No way, they\u2019ll probably move it to Tuesday if they have a wedding on the beach on Monday like ours\u2026\u201d<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI dismissed and dismissed it \u2013 he kept bugging me to confirm with the wedding planner so FINALLY I did\u2026.and guess what?!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThey don\u2019t move it!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nAt first she suggested we move it to pool side BUT Chris and I met on the beach literally in Cuba! And he proposed in Punta Cana\u2026.we love the Caribbean and we want to get married with our feet in the sand just as we met! <3<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI freaked out at first! Chris too!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSo the wedding planner offered another option! On one side of the beach will be the beach party and on the other side of the beach our ceremony and reception\u2026.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nAt first we considered it but then I remembered that the beach at the Royalton is only 85 yards across! Now ladies I don\u2019t know what distance that is LOL so my fianc\u00e9 showed me! He was like from here to that house! LOL and it wasn\u2019t far at all\u2026..<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nAnyways, I\u2019m writing a novel!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nTo keep it short! We\u2019ve now moved our date to Tuesday, November 18<sup>th<\/sup>, 2014.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSUCKS! But what can you do\u2026..<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nGuess just wanted to post on here <span><strong>NOT <\/strong><\/span>to book your wedding on a <span><strong>Monday <\/strong><\/span>if you want it on the beach!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nGood luck ladies!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nXoxoxox Pam<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nWow! This is very good to know! And thank you so much for the email, it is very helpful. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.173.224.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399403082,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5dce43fdfc5d4bb55ef6133ff3e2113e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1829185\" timestamp=\"1390861443\"]\nHello future brides!! I&#039;ve been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.\n\nNOW, we are ready! And I&#039;m super duper excited to get started!!\n\nWe always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...\n\nI came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.\n\nWell, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! :)\n\nAnyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can&#039;t find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!\n\nHappy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!\n\nPam :) xo[\/quote][quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1829185\" timestamp=\"1390861443\"]\nHello future brides!! I&#039;ve been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.\n\nNOW, we are ready! And I&#039;m super duper excited to get started!!\n\nWe always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...\n\nI came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.\n\nWell, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! :)\n\nAnyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can&#039;t find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!\n\nHappy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!\n\nPam :) xo[\/quote]\n\n@[member=\"pamelas21\"] Hi im getting married here in july...can you send me the links you have because they say i dont have enough post to open [email=\"them....shari124@hotmail.com\"]them....shari124@hotmail.com[\/email]\n\nalso did you do a full wedding or the just for two package?","Attachments":[],"Id":1848473,"PostDate":1399402955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 27 January 2014 - 03:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello future brides!! I've been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>NOW, we are ready! And I'm super duper excited to get started!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can't find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> xo<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 27 January 2014 - 03:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello future brides!! I've been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>NOW, we are ready! And I'm super duper excited to get started!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can't find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> xo<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a> Hi im getting married here in july...can you send me the links you have because they say i dont have enough post to open <a href='mailto:them....shari124@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>them....shari124@hotmail.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>also did you do a full wedding or the just for two package?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shari124@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.173.224.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399402390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277863.jpg?_r=1399406079","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":279,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saj8380","Id":277863,"Name":"saj8380","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1532ad42dd767289caa9abb5f731743","RawContent":"[quote name=\"saj8380\" post=\"1848473\" timestamp=\"1399399355\"]\n\n\n@[member=\"pamelas21\"] Hi im getting married here in july...can you send me the links you have because they say i dont have enough post to open [email=\"them....shari124@hotmail.com\"]them....shari124@hotmail.com[\/email]\n\nalso did you do a full wedding or the just for two package?[\/quote]\nHi! Just sent you everything!\n\nAre you getting married THIS july?\n\nI&#039;m having 51 guests plus Fi and I it&#039;s 53 total so I&#039;m doing a full wedding!\n\nI&#039;m just starting to work with the wedding planner on the details - not sure if the packages are for me seeing as I have more than 20 people.\n\nPlus I&#039;m having a private beach wedding so I think I&#039;m going to go the ala carte route!\n\nKeep everyone posted on your plans!\n\nI&#039;ll share - every one share!\n\nWould love to read what other brides are doing!\n\nTake care! :)\n\nPam","Attachments":[],"Id":1848474,"PostDate":1399403556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>saj8380, on 06 May 2014 - 11:02 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a> Hi im getting married here in july...can you send me the links you have because they say i dont have enough post to open <a href='mailto:them....shari124@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>them....shari124@hotmail.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>also did you do a full wedding or the just for two package?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi! Just sent you everything!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you getting married THIS july?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm having 51 guests plus Fi and I it's 53 total so I'm doing a full wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm just starting to work with the wedding planner on the details - not sure if the packages are for me seeing as I have more than 20 people.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Plus I'm having a private beach wedding so I think I'm going to go the ala carte route!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Keep everyone posted on your plans!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll share - every one share!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would love to read what other brides are doing!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Take care! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6457d9a20916da7fdcd3a6994c1ee5b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just curious who everyone has booked for photography?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848490,"PostDate":1399410814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just curious who everyone has booked for photography?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0872ebfd4db63e43efd06c571bfadce6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I\u2019ve been wondering the same thing!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019m currently looking!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019m booking Elite Media for the videography\u2026but I\u2019m stumped on a photographer!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It\u2019s hard to pick!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far I\u2019ve gotten quotes from:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stacey Clarke&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Merrick Cousley&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Visual Embrace&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Marcia E. Roberts&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Brian Nejedly&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Saab Weddings&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019m being very indecisive! Which is not good!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A bride on here wrote some tips for other brides and she said to stick to your decision once you\u2019ve made it! Otherwise you\u2019re biting your nails going back and forth wondering if you made the right choice!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;GAH! And I\u2019m doing the opposite!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ladies, let us know who you\u2019ve booked and why! We\u2019d love to know!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pam&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848496,"PostDate":1399412335,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I\u2019ve been wondering the same thing!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019m currently looking!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019m booking Elite Media for the videography\u2026but I\u2019m stumped on a photographer!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It\u2019s hard to pick!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So far I\u2019ve gotten quotes from:<\/p>\n<p>Stacey Clarke<\/p>\n<p>Merrick Cousley<\/p>\n<p>Visual Embrace<\/p>\n<p>Marcia E. Roberts<\/p>\n<p>Brian Nejedly<\/p>\n<p>Saab Weddings<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019m being very indecisive! Which is not good!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A bride on here wrote some tips for other brides and she said to stick to your decision once you\u2019ve made it! Otherwise you\u2019re biting your nails going back and forth wondering if you made the right choice!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>GAH! And I\u2019m doing the opposite!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ladies, let us know who you\u2019ve booked and why! We\u2019d love to know!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efe5e9b22678ffd580c2c1502c371068","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1848490\" timestamp=\"1399407214\"]\nJust curious who everyone has booked for photography?[\/quote]\nIf I get the wedding date I&#039;ve requested I will more than likely go with the resort photographer. The Royalton charges a $450 USD vendor fee to use an outside photographer. I just can&#039;t bring myself to pay that for just the vendor fee plus a photography package.","Attachments":[],"Id":1848506,"PostDate":1399414955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 06 May 2014 - 01:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Just curious who everyone has booked for photography?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nIf I get the wedding date I've requested I will more than likely go with the resort photographer. The Royalton charges a $450 USD vendor fee to use an outside photographer. I just can't bring myself to pay that for just the vendor fee plus a photography package. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.222","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd93bc4fad624f185a9f71cb4294c160","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848506\" timestamp=\"1399411355\"]\nIf I get the wedding date I&#039;ve requested I will more than likely go with the resort photographer. The Royalton charges a $450 USD vendor fee to use an outside photographer. I just can&#039;t bring myself to pay that for just the vendor fee plus a photography package.[\/quote]It all depends on how much photography you want...and if you like the resort photographer....\n\nI&#039;m looking for all day coverage from 2pm to 11pm and I thought the royalton prices were VERY high!\n\nSo I shopped around and guess what outside photographers are cheaper AND some of them cover the $450 vendor fee!\n\nMy fianc\u00e9 and I got several quotes, now we just have to decide but we&#039;re definitely not going with the resort photographer!\n\nHope this helps!\n\nPam","Attachments":[],"Id":1848514,"PostDate":1399417673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 06 May 2014 - 02:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>If I get the wedding date I've requested I will more than likely go with the resort photographer. The Royalton charges a $450 USD vendor fee to use an outside photographer. I just can't bring myself to pay that for just the vendor fee plus a photography package.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nIt all depends on how much photography you want...and if you like the resort photographer....<br><br>\nI'm looking for all day coverage from 2pm to 11pm and I thought the royalton prices were VERY high!<br><br>\nSo I shopped around and guess what outside photographers are cheaper AND some of them cover the $450 vendor fee!<br><br>\nMy fianc\u00e9 and I got several quotes, now we just have to decide but we're definitely not going with the resort photographer!<br><br>\nHope this helps!<br><br>\nPam\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":358,"TotalPages":36,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
