> Time: 1442717148 / Sun, 20 Sep 2015 02:45:48 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=76145&start=70&SessionId=24b01a51e66f20b1635eb993109292ee
> User Toyal (284663)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d70469d093c9c229a373cc99045e0c1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Dimps\" post=\"1848546\" timestamp=\"1399423054\"]\nHas anyone seen pics of the skylight patio? Or labelled pics of all the other location options?[\/quote]\nGah! Ladies, I\u2019m JUST hearing about this skylight patio which is insane! And it\u2019s my first time seeing this document (Royalton Event Policies &amp;amp; Procedures) that Dimps has graciously shared with me! Thanks Dimps!\n\nTurns out the Skylight patio is the only COMPLETELY private area to host a ceremony. Note that\u2019s it\u2019s 7 floors, 42 steps up, no elevator\u2026.Either way my fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married on the beach but I thought it best to note it for other brides interested!\n\nIf any of you want to see the doc, please let me or Dimps know \u2013 we\u2019d be happy to email it!\n\nI\u2019ve also posted it here as an attachment.\n\nI want to thank all of you for keeping this thread going and for posting helpful stuff, etc. YOU GUYS ROCK!\n\nWishing you all a beautiful wedding day! &amp;lt;3\n\nPam","Attachments":[],"Id":1848632,"PostDate":1399478928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Dimps, on 06 May 2014 - 05:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Has anyone seen pics of the skylight patio? Or labelled pics of all the other location options?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gah! Ladies, I\u2019m JUST hearing about this skylight patio which is insane! And it\u2019s my first time seeing this document (Royalton Event Policies & Procedures) that Dimps has graciously shared with me! Thanks Dimps!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Turns out the Skylight patio is the only COMPLETELY private area to host a ceremony. Note that\u2019s it\u2019s 7 floors, 42 steps up, no elevator\u2026.Either way my fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married on the beach but I thought it best to note it for other brides interested!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If any of you want to see the doc, please let me or Dimps know \u2013 we\u2019d be happy to email it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019ve also posted it here as an attachment.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I want to thank all of you for keeping this thread going and for posting helpful stuff, etc. YOU GUYS ROCK!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all a beautiful wedding day! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"376789396aa3de8e0111426ea116d3ae","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dec2014star\" post=\"1848585\" timestamp=\"1399434558\"]\nHi Pam and everyone else =)\n\nI really put the planning to the back burner but should start more working at it again.\n\nAgain our wedding will be this year December as mentioned before.\n\nI think Pam we are kinda have a similar vision as to what we want.\n\nI also have more than 20ppl...35 so far?\nI am also thinking of beach reception, so my understanding is that is cost 300 to set up the beach reception, probably more for  decor?\n\n I havn&#039;t really looked at what the Al la carte entails.\n\nDid you receive any other pics or brochures from them? \n\nAnd I just want to ask everyone about photography.\n- in the package; there is a 1hour photographer included but probably not going to use it for the rest of the day\n\nI&#039;m just wondering what you guys think about this.  My aunt and uncle does wedding photography for family and church friends...they are not professional per se... they don&#039;t have samples or anything like that.  I have asked them to help me for the videography but they said they will bring all their equipment and they even said that they have this underwater cam and can do shots there too... \n\nBut somehow I am having some second thought? They have paid their deposits and my Fi and I are planning on paying for the rest of their trip. On one end we are saving some $$ because a professional photographer will cost at least 3-4grand plus the 450vendor fee? =(\n\nAny thoughts girls?\n\nIs anyone going to have the ceremony at the beach gazebo? did anyone talk about decorations there yet?\n\nAnd also, is anyone having a legal ceremony there? as oppose to the other one I forgot the name\n\nSorry this seems to be a very long post.\n\nAgain happy planning everyone.\n\nI heard Chasity Artistry Rashel Edwards is pretty good for hair and make-up.. u can find her on FB\nMy co worker used her and I booked her as well[\/quote]\nHi Pam and everyone else =)\n[color=#ff0000]Hey Polly! Haven\u2019t talked to you in a while! :)[\/color] [color=#ff0000]I added all my responses in red! &amp;lt;3[\/color]\n\nI really put the planning to the back burner but should start more working at it again.\n[color=#ff0000]I did too \u2013 the wedding planner told me we wouldn\u2019t start planning until June for my November 18[sup]th[\/sup], 2014 wedding BUT this issue with may date changing changed everything! Now I\u2019ve told her I want to start planning now and getting things more organized and she says that\u2019s fine.[\/color]\n\nAgain our wedding will be this year December as mentioned before.\n[color=#ff0000]YAY Congrats![\/color]\n\nI think Pam we are kinda have a similar vision as to what we want.\n\nI also have more than 20ppl...35 so far?\n[color=#ff0000]Wow, 35 \u2013 that\u2019s awesome![\/color]\n\nI am also thinking of beach reception, so my understanding is that is cost 300 to set up the beach reception, probably more for  decor?\n[color=#ff0000]Yup, ladies please note it WAS $10 per person for beach or poolside reception set up! But that\u2019s been changed! It\u2019s now $300 for set up total which is great \u2013 I save some money! Yup d\u00e9cor is definitely extra![\/color]\n\n I havn&#039;t really looked at what the Al la carte entails.\n[color=#ff0000]We\u2019re hosting our rehearsal dinner at the Italian a la carte! I wanted the steakhouse but it\u2019s too small for my group![\/color]\n\nDid you receive any other pics or brochures from them?\n[color=#ff0000]Polly, I\u2019ll email you everything I have again so you have everything that\u2019s new![\/color]\n\nAnd I just want to ask everyone about photography.\n- in the package; there is a 1hour photographer included but probably not going to use it for the rest of the day\nI&#039;m just wondering what you guys think about this.  My aunt and uncle does wedding photography for family and church friends...they are not professional per se... they don&#039;t have samples or anything like that.  I have asked them to help me for the videography but they said they will bring all their equipment and they even said that they have this underwater cam and can do shots there too...\nBut somehow I am having some second thought? They have paid their deposits and my Fi and I are planning on paying for the rest of their trip. On one end we are saving some $$ because a professional photographer will cost at least 3-4grand plus the 450vendor fee? =( Any thoughts girls?\n[color=#ff0000] I would say go with your heart! I will be honest, my fianc\u00e9\u2019s aunt is a photographer BUT she does landscapes! She did my engagement party and I just have to be honest and say I wasn\u2019t happy! \u2026.sorry if that\u2019s bad [font=wingdings]:([\/font] She offered to do the wedding as well and this time I respectfully declined! Photos are 2[sup]nd[\/sup] most important to me! &amp;lt;3 I would suggest looking around and getting quotes for sure! Go with your gut![\/color]\n\n[color=#ff0000]So far I\u2019ve gotten quotes from:[\/color]\n[color=#ff0000]Stacey Clarke[\/color]\n[color=#ff0000]Merrick Cousley[\/color]\n[color=#ff0000]Visual Embrace[\/color]\n[color=#ff0000]Marcia E Roberts[\/color]\n[color=#ff0000]Brian Nejedly[\/color]\n[color=#ff0000]Saab Weddings[\/color]\n\n[color=#ff0000]I\u2019m waiting on a quote from Dwayne Watkins and then Fi and I will decide! It\u2019s honestly very hard to decide \u2013 at least for me \u2013 probably because it\u2019s so BEYOND important for me! &amp;lt;3[\/color]\n\nIs anyone going to have the ceremony at the beach gazebo? did anyone talk about decorations there yet?\n[color=#ff0000]I\u2019m getting married on the beach (not gazebo) so we\u2019re renting a Chuppah\/canopy\u2026..the Royalton works with Tai Flora - here\u2019s the link:[\/color] [url=\"http:\/\/www.taiflora.com\/index.php\"]http:\/\/www.taiflora.com\/index.php[\/url]\n\nAnd also, is anyone having a legal ceremony there? as oppose to the other one I forgot the name\n[color=#ff0000]We\u2019re having a legal ceremony! YAY! I immigrated to Canada so I\u2019m going to have to get my birth certificate notarized and then translated from Spanish into English I think! I have to look into this![\/color]\n\nSorry this seems to be a very long post.\n[color=#ff0000]Don\u2019t even worry about it \u2013 that\u2019s what we\u2019re here for \u2013 to help each other![\/color]\n\nAgain happy planning everyone.\n\nI heard Chasity Artistry Rashel Edwards is pretty good for hair and make-up.. u can find her on FB My co worker used her and I booked her as well\n\n[color=#ff0000]You booked Rashel Edwards for BOTH hair and makeup? Be warned! I read on that policies and procedures document that as of this moment the Royalton is ONLY allowing Photographers and Videographers as outside vendors. Everything else HAS to be their preferred vendor! Did you confirm with Laura (wedding planner) that you can bring Rashel Edwards in? Let me know![\/color]\n\n[color=#ff0000]Wishing you all the best Polly![\/color]\n\n[color=#ff0000]Keep us posted with your plans and good luck![\/color]\n\n[color=#ff0000]Pam[\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1848642,"PostDate":1399482016,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dec2014star, on 06 May 2014 - 08:49 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Pam and everyone else =)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really put the planning to the back burner but should start more working at it again.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Again our wedding will be this year December as mentioned before.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think Pam we are kinda have a similar vision as to what we want.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also have more than 20ppl...35 so far?<\/p>\n<p>I am also thinking of beach reception, so my understanding is that is cost 300 to set up the beach reception, probably more for \u00a0decor?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I havn't really looked at what the Al la carte entails.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you receive any other pics or brochures from them?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And I just want to ask everyone about photography.<\/p>\n<p>- in the package; there is a 1hour photographer included but probably not going to use it for the rest of the day<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm just wondering what you guys think about this. \u00a0My aunt and uncle does wedding photography for family and church friends...they are not professional per se... they don't have samples or anything like that. \u00a0I have asked them to help me for the videography but they said they will bring all their equipment and they even said that they have this underwater cam and can do shots there too...\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But somehow I am having some second thought? They have paid their deposits and my Fi and I are planning on paying for the rest of their trip. On one end we are saving some $$ because a professional photographer will cost at least 3-4grand plus the 450vendor fee? =(<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any thoughts girls?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is anyone going to have the ceremony at the beach gazebo? did anyone talk about decorations there yet?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And also, is anyone having a legal ceremony there? as oppose to the other one I forgot the name<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry this seems to be a very long post.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Again happy planning everyone.<\/p>\n<br><p>I heard Chasity Artistry Rashel Edwards is pretty good for hair and make-up.. u can find her on FB<\/p>\n<p>My co worker used her and I booked her as well<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Pam and everyone else =)<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Hey Polly! Haven\u2019t talked to you in a while! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span> <span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">I added all my responses in red! <3<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really put the planning to the back burner but should start more working at it again.<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">I did too \u2013 the wedding planner told me we wouldn\u2019t start planning until June for my November 18<sup>th<\/sup>, 2014 wedding BUT this issue with may date changing changed everything! Now I\u2019ve told her I want to start planning now and getting things more organized and she says that\u2019s fine.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Again our wedding will be this year December as mentioned before.<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">YAY Congrats!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think Pam we are kinda have a similar vision as to what we want.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also have more than 20ppl...35 so far?<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Wow, 35 \u2013 that\u2019s awesome!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am also thinking of beach reception, so my understanding is that is cost 300 to set up the beach reception, probably more for\u00a0 decor?<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Yup, ladies please note it WAS $10 per person for beach or poolside reception set up! But that\u2019s been changed! It\u2019s now $300 for set up total which is great \u2013 I save some money! Yup d\u00e9cor is definitely extra!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I havn't really looked at what the Al la carte entails.<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">We\u2019re hosting our rehearsal dinner at the Italian a la carte! I wanted the steakhouse but it\u2019s too small for my group!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you receive any other pics or brochures from them?<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Polly, I\u2019ll email you everything I have again so you have everything that\u2019s new!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And I just want to ask everyone about photography.<\/p>\n<p>- in the package; there is a 1hour photographer included but probably not going to use it for the rest of the day<\/p>\n<p>I'm just wondering what you guys think about this.\u00a0 My aunt and uncle does wedding photography for family and church friends...they are not professional per se... they don't have samples or anything like that.\u00a0 I have asked them to help me for the videography but they said they will bring all their equipment and they even said that they have this underwater cam and can do shots there too...<\/p>\n<p>But somehow I am having some second thought? They have paid their deposits and my Fi and I are planning on paying for the rest of their trip. On one end we are saving some $$ because a professional photographer will cost at least 3-4grand plus the 450vendor fee? =( Any thoughts girls?<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">\u00a0I would say go with your heart! I will be honest, my fianc\u00e9\u2019s aunt is a photographer BUT she does landscapes! She did my engagement party and I just have to be honest and say I wasn\u2019t happy! \u2026.sorry if that\u2019s bad <span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/span> She offered to do the wedding as well and this time I respectfully declined! Photos are 2<sup>nd<\/sup> most important to me! <3 I would suggest looking around and getting quotes for sure! Go with your gut!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">So far I\u2019ve gotten quotes from:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Stacey Clarke<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Merrick Cousley<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Visual Embrace<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Marcia E Roberts<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Brian Nejedly<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Saab Weddings<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">I\u2019m waiting on a quote from Dwayne Watkins and then Fi and I will decide! It\u2019s honestly very hard to decide \u2013 at least for me \u2013 probably because it\u2019s so BEYOND important for me! <3<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is anyone going to have the ceremony at the beach gazebo? did anyone talk about decorations there yet?<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">I\u2019m getting married on the beach (not gazebo) so we\u2019re renting a Chuppah\/canopy\u2026..the Royalton works with Tai Flora - here\u2019s the link:<\/span> <a href='http:\/\/www.taiflora.com\/index.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.taiflora.com\/index.php<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And also, is anyone having a legal ceremony there? as oppose to the other one I forgot the name<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">We\u2019re having a legal ceremony! YAY! I immigrated to Canada so I\u2019m going to have to get my birth certificate notarized and then translated from Spanish into English I think! I have to look into this!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry this seems to be a very long post.<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Don\u2019t even worry about it \u2013 that\u2019s what we\u2019re here for \u2013 to help each other!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Again happy planning everyone.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I heard Chasity Artistry Rashel Edwards is pretty good for hair and make-up.. u can find her on FB My co worker used her and I booked her as well<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">You booked Rashel Edwards for BOTH hair and makeup? Be warned! I read on that policies and procedures document that as of this moment the Royalton is ONLY allowing Photographers and Videographers as outside vendors. Everything else HAS to be their preferred vendor! Did you confirm with Laura (wedding planner) that you can bring Rashel Edwards in? Let me know!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Wishing you all the best Polly!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Keep us posted with your plans and good luck!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Pam<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73b767744b89da46a7cf05937bc9a90b","RawContent":"We\u2019ve decided to bring our own photographer from home (she\u2019s doing our engagement photos and our at-home church wedding), it\u2019s an extra cost but I\u2019ve seen her in action before at a previous destination wedding I went to, so I know she knows her stuff and vibes with us.\n[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848417\" timestamp=\"1399388862\"]\nWow! 51 booked already! That&#039;s great! We are planning a small wedding immediate family and our closest friends. We have 30 on our invite list and are expecting 20 or so to book. I&#039;m so excited. Choosing the resort was so stressful, I&#039;ve spent the last 3 weeks searching forums, reading reviews etc. I really hope the Royalton has space for our wedding. Hoping to get a response today sometime. (We are also booking with Sunwing :)\n\nWe are from Northern Ontario (just outside Sudbury).\n[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848406\" timestamp=\"1399385801\"]\n\nI&#039;m from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!\n\nWe have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!\n\nSo excited for you! How many people are you expecting?\n\nPam[\/quote][\/quote]I\u2019m also Canadian! From Scarborough specifically. :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1848668,"PostDate":1399487956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We\u2019ve decided to bring our own photographer from home (she\u2019s doing our engagement photos and our at-home church wedding), it\u2019s an extra cost but I\u2019ve seen her in action before at a previous destination wedding I went to, so I know she knows her stuff and vibes with us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 06 May 2014 - 08:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow! 51 booked already! That's great! We are planning a small wedding immediate family and our closest friends. We have 30 on our invite list and are expecting 20 or so to book. I'm so excited. Choosing the resort was so stressful, I've spent the last 3 weeks searching forums, reading reviews etc. I really hope the Royalton has space for our wedding. Hoping to get a response today sometime. (We are also booking with Sunwing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nWe are from Northern Ontario (just outside Sudbury).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"pamelas21\" data-cid=\"1848406\" data-time=\"1399385801\">\n<div>\n<p>I'm from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited for you! How many people are you expecting?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p>I\u2019m also Canadian! From Scarborough specifically. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389147080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"130.154.0.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7324f9dab88f181cafa5be9dc9183d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dec2014star\"], I agree with Pam about the photos...go with your heart. I had a friend who preferred her uncle&#039;s pictures to those of the professional photographer they paid over $4k for, so you never know. If your aunt and uncle have done wedding photography previously, that is a huge plus because they have experience with the stress and speed of a wedding. You only get one chance to capture some of the moments. You may want to consider having the professional (along with your aunt and uncle) capture the actual ceremony and then a few couple shots after (or whichever shots are most important to you) during their hour. Staged pictures are much easier to get correct as you&#039;re not in a rush. Also, consider doing research on posing so if your aunt and uncle can&#039;t direct you into the shots, you can know what angles make you and your fiance look best. Lastly, worst case if you don&#039;t love the editing of the photos, you can send them out and get them touched up by someone else.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"pamelas21\"], I&#039;m really glad to hear that they let you start planning earlier than mentioned! I want to start planning now, but my wedding isn&#039;t until next April haha. Also, you mention photography is 2nd most important to you...just curious, how does your list pan out (i.e. what&#039;s important to you and what&#039;s not)?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SoEze\"], see below for some info on photography quotes I received.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dean Clarke Photography&lt;\/strong&gt;: All packages include full wedding coverage with 2 photographers. At least 300 pictures for $2600; 500-600 pictures + some prints for $3100; At least 800 pictures + some prints + photo book for $3600; TTD session is $500 additional to any package&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPAJ (Wedding Photographers Association of Jamaica)&lt;\/strong&gt;: 3 hours for $1175; 5 hours for $1675; 8 hours with 2 photographers + 2 hours for honeymoon, rehearsal, or TTD for $2175&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brian Nejedly&lt;\/strong&gt;: Will pay up to $350 of resort fee for all packages. 3 hours for $1550; 5 hours for $1900; 8 hours with 2 photographers for $2800; 8-9 hours with 2 photographers + TTD or rehearsal dinner + photo album for $3500&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lastly, does anyone have any pictures of the different reception areas available? I saw some photos from a wedding that took place there (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/saruniaphotography.com\/tag\/royalton-white-sands-resort\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/saruniaphotography.com\/tag\/royalton-white-sands-resort\/&lt;\/a&gt;), but I wasn&#039;t sure what location they used for their reception (in looks like it took place somewhere covered but open to the outdoors). I&#039;d also love to see what poolside looks like. Thanks so much! &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848670,"PostDate":1399488427,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276258\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276258-dec2014star\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dec2014star<\/span><\/a>, I agree with Pam about the photos...go with your heart. I had a friend who preferred her uncle's pictures to those of the professional photographer they paid over $4k for, so you never know. If your aunt and uncle have done wedding photography previously, that is a huge plus because they have experience with the stress and speed of a wedding. You only get one chance to capture some of the moments. You may want to consider having the professional (along with your aunt and uncle) capture the actual ceremony and then a few couple shots after (or whichever shots are most important to you) during their hour. Staged pictures are much easier to get correct as you're not in a rush. Also, consider doing research on posing so if your aunt and uncle can't direct you into the shots, you can know what angles make you and your fiance look best. Lastly, worst case if you don't love the editing of the photos, you can send them out and get them touched up by someone else.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a>, I'm really glad to hear that they let you start planning earlier than mentioned! I want to start planning now, but my wedding isn't until next April haha. Also, you mention photography is 2nd most important to you...just curious, how does your list pan out (i.e. what's important to you and what's not)?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277799\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277799-soeze\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SoEze<\/span><\/a>, see below for some info on photography quotes I received.<\/p>\n<ul><li><strong>Dean Clarke Photography<\/strong>: All packages include full wedding coverage with 2 photographers. At least 300 pictures for $2600; 500-600 pictures + some prints for $3100; At least 800 pictures + some prints + photo book for $3600; TTD session is $500 additional to any package<\/li>\n<li><strong>WPAJ (Wedding Photographers Association of Jamaica)<\/strong>: 3 hours for $1175; 5 hours for $1675; 8 hours with 2 photographers + 2 hours for honeymoon, rehearsal, or TTD for $2175<\/li>\n<li><strong>Brian Nejedly<\/strong>: Will pay up to $350 of resort fee for all packages. 3 hours for $1550; 5 hours for $1900; 8 hours with 2 photographers for $2800; 8-9 hours with 2 photographers + TTD or rehearsal dinner + photo album for $3500<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lastly, does anyone have any pictures of the different reception areas available? I saw some photos from a wedding that took place there (<a href='http:\/\/saruniaphotography.com\/tag\/royalton-white-sands-resort\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/saruniaphotog...e-sands-resort\/<\/a>), but I wasn't sure what location they used for their reception (in looks like it took place somewhere covered but open to the outdoors). I'd also love to see what poolside looks like. Thanks so much! <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cherylk1234@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.184.186.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396148555,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CherJK","Id":277400,"Name":"CherJK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53992f42952c21509b9d8fab65e4b09c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"CherJK\"] Oh my gosh thanks for sharing that link! I hadn&#039;t seen it yet! So happy we&#039;re all gathering more and more photos and info on this place!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I honestly don&#039;t know where her reception was located - my guess would be one of the a la cartes.....I&#039;m going to email Laura and ask her!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I guess you could say everything is important to me! LOL I&#039;m a virgo - total flipping perfectionist!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;BUT at the same time I REALLY dislike how much weddings cost! It&#039;s crazy how much photography, videography, etc cost!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Getting married on the beach with our toes in the sand...just like we met...that&#039;s most important to me! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At the end of the day though, little things don&#039;t matter! I&#039;m sure all of us will not regret choosing the Royalton! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, I don&#039;t have any photos with a wedding set up yet - hopefully as they have more weddings we&#039;ll be able to see more....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re lucky - your weddings not till April!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll be sure to give you EVERY detail you need when I return from my wedding in November &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848674,"PostDate":1399489597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277400\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277400-cherjk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CherJK<\/span><\/a> Oh my gosh thanks for sharing that link! I hadn't seen it yet! So happy we're all gathering more and more photos and info on this place!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I honestly don't know where her reception was located - my guess would be one of the a la cartes.....I'm going to email Laura and ask her!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I guess you could say everything is important to me! LOL I'm a virgo - total flipping perfectionist!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>BUT at the same time I REALLY dislike how much weddings cost! It's crazy how much photography, videography, etc cost!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Getting married on the beach with our toes in the sand...just like we met...that's most important to me! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At the end of the day though, little things don't matter! I'm sure all of us will not regret choosing the Royalton! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I don't have any photos with a wedding set up yet - hopefully as they have more weddings we'll be able to see more....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're lucky - your weddings not till April!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll be sure to give you EVERY detail you need when I return from my wedding in November <3<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"130.154.0.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399491532,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da4cd755f53755a77259ba09d50c6a1f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848674\" timestamp=\"1399485997\"]\n@[member=\"CherJK\"] Oh my gosh thanks for sharing that link! I hadn&#039;t seen it yet! So happy we&#039;re all gathering more and more photos and info on this place!!\n\nI honestly don&#039;t know where her reception was located - my guess would be one of the a la cartes.....I&#039;m going to email Laura and ask her!\n\nI guess you could say everything is important to me! LOL I&#039;m a virgo - total flipping perfectionist!\n\nBUT at the same time I REALLY dislike how much weddings cost! It&#039;s crazy how much photography, videography, etc cost!\n\nGetting married on the beach with our toes in the sand...just like we met...that&#039;s most important to me! &amp;lt;3\n\nAt the end of the day though, little things don&#039;t matter! I&#039;m sure all of us will not regret choosing the Royalton! :)\n\nUnfortunately, I don&#039;t have any photos with a wedding set up yet - hopefully as they have more weddings we&#039;ll be able to see more....\n\nYou&#039;re lucky - your weddings not till April!\n\nI&#039;ll be sure to give you EVERY detail you need when I return from my wedding in November &amp;lt;3[\/quote]\nAgreed with hating how much weddings cost haha! Do you mind if I ask what you are planning to spend when all is said and done? However, I of course understand if you would rather not share that information. My budget was originally $15k, but it looks like it&#039;ll be closer to $20k for about 60 guests (includes our travel, rings, photography, everything, but we are cutting corners by bringing fake flowers, doing the Jamaican experience menu, etc.). However, I want to see if that is realistic since I won&#039;t have a detailed quote for everything until the date is closer and we actually start working with the resort.\n\nI&#039;m really looking forward to seeing how your wedding looks! :)\n\nFound another wedding! It&#039;s a renewal but shows a lot of cool places to get some couple pictures...[url=\"http:\/\/jamaicaweddingphotographer.blogspot.com\/2014\/04\/niya-ethan-destination-jamaica-wedding.html\"]http:\/\/jamaicaweddingphotographer.blogspot.com\/2014\/04\/niya-ethan-destination-jamaica-wedding.html[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1848676,"PostDate":1399491110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 07 May 2014 - 11:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277400\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277400-cherjk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CherJK<\/span><\/a> Oh my gosh thanks for sharing that link! I hadn't seen it yet! So happy we're all gathering more and more photos and info on this place!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I honestly don't know where her reception was located - my guess would be one of the a la cartes.....I'm going to email Laura and ask her!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I guess you could say everything is important to me! LOL I'm a virgo - total flipping perfectionist!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>BUT at the same time I REALLY dislike how much weddings cost! It's crazy how much photography, videography, etc cost!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Getting married on the beach with our toes in the sand...just like we met...that's most important to me! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At the end of the day though, little things don't matter! I'm sure all of us will not regret choosing the Royalton! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I don't have any photos with a wedding set up yet - hopefully as they have more weddings we'll be able to see more....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're lucky - your weddings not till April!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll be sure to give you EVERY detail you need when I return from my wedding in November <3<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Agreed with hating how much weddings cost haha! Do you mind if I ask what you are planning to spend when all is said and done? However, I of course understand if you would rather not share that information. My budget was originally $15k, but it looks like it'll be closer to $20k for about 60 guests (includes our travel, rings, photography, everything, but we are cutting corners by bringing fake flowers, doing the Jamaican experience menu, etc.). However, I want to see if that is realistic since I won't have a detailed quote for everything until the date is closer and we actually start working with the resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm really looking forward to seeing how your wedding looks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<br><p>Found another wedding! It's a renewal but shows a lot of cool places to get some couple pictures...<a href='http:\/\/jamaicaweddingphotographer.blogspot.com\/2014\/04\/niya-ethan-destination-jamaica-wedding.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/jamaicaweddin...ca-wedding.html<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cherylk1234@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.184.186.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396148555,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CherJK","Id":277400,"Name":"CherJK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff9f4435099503494560529525799e4a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"CherJK\"]!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Oh my gosh you\u2019re so good with finding photos :D :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848679,"PostDate":1399491815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277400\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277400-cherjk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CherJK<\/span><\/a>!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh my gosh you\u2019re so good with finding photos <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.116.42.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfa102b25f4461a7ed24edeee6670484","RawContent":"Thanks @[member=\"CherJK\"]! You guys are great at sharing and finding info. I haven&#039;t been so lucky. I truly appreciate the openness and info sharing in this forum","Attachments":[],"Id":1848772,"PostDate":1399502034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277400\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277400-cherjk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CherJK<\/span><\/a>! You guys are great at sharing and finding info. I haven't been so lucky. I truly appreciate the openness and info sharing in this forum\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.236.233.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398959437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SoEze","Id":277799,"Name":"SoEze","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67b3fa2b3ec941b9ac0af0cd823ea958","RawContent":"Crap Rashel Edwards is booked for my day!\n\n\nMan I&#039;m getting close! Gotta start locking ppl in!\n\n\n6 months to go!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848809,"PostDate":1399503713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Crap Rashel Edwards is booked for my day!<br><br>\nMan I'm getting close! Gotta start locking ppl in!<br><br>\n6 months to go!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6779e4c2a6e6f4fb02ac88365d7d14b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow @[member=\"CherJK\"] thanks for sharing your finds!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848855,"PostDate":1399511338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277400\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277400-cherjk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CherJK<\/span><\/a> thanks for sharing your finds!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389147080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":358,"TotalPages":3