Laura the coordinator here in Toronto yet...\n\nBut I have read the policy and procedure part and it does sound a little alarming...but I called Laura and she did tell me only decor vendors and florist are not allowed \nSo hope all turns out alright.....","Attachments":[],"Id":1848932,"PostDate":1399554370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 07 May 2014 - 09:18 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hey Polly!<br>\nYou said you booked Rashel right? So are you paying a vendor fee to have her come in?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI assume I have to..I just reserved her first because I figured that part was important to me and I know she's pretty popular and I like what she does....I haven't talked or planned anything with Laura the coordinator here in Toronto yet...<br><br>\nBut I have read the policy and procedure part and it does sound a little alarming...but I called Laura and she did tell me only decor vendors and florist are not allowed <br>\nSo hope all turns out alright.....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pollyt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.197.185.168","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1390377255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dec2014star","Id":276258,"Name":"dec2014star","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8523ccb4e7db112759786d6610955bc8","RawContent":"Anyone know if the resort changes a set up fee to set up our own decorations?\nSorry charges not changes","Attachments":[],"Id":1848933,"PostDate":1399555188,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Anyone know if the resort changes a set up fee to set up our own decorations?<br \/>Sorry charges not changes\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a9bc49f2970787ddce980592f9aa933","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dec2014star\" post=\"1848932\" timestamp=\"1399550770\"]\nI assume I have to..I just reserved her first because I figured that part was important to me and I know she&#039;s pretty popular and I like what she does....I haven&#039;t talked or planned anything with Laura the coordinator here in Toronto yet...\n\nBut I have read the policy and procedure part and it does sound a little alarming...but I called Laura and she did tell me only decor vendors and florist are not allowed\nSo hope all turns out alright.....[\/quote]\nHey Polly,\n\nI emailed her and asked if we would have to pay the vendor fee for make up and hair....let&#039;s see what she says - keep you posted!\n[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848933\" timestamp=\"1399551588\"]\nAnyone know if the resort changes a set up fee to set up our own decorations?\nSorry charges not changes[\/quote]\nHey Bridetobe771!\n\nI emailed Laura and asked her about this....I think we would all like to know!\n\nKeep you posted!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848948,"PostDate":1399563991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dec2014star, on 08 May 2014 - 05:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I assume I have to..I just reserved her first because I figured that part was important to me and I know she's pretty popular and I like what she does....I haven't talked or planned anything with Laura the coordinator here in Toronto yet...<br><br>\nBut I have read the policy and procedure part and it does sound a little alarming...but I called Laura and she did tell me only decor vendors and florist are not allowed<br>\nSo hope all turns out alright.....<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey Polly,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I emailed her and asked if we would have to pay the vendor fee for make up and hair....let's see what she says - keep you posted!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 08 May 2014 - 05:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Anyone know if the resort changes a set up fee to set up our own decorations?<br>\nSorry charges not changes<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey Bridetobe771!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I emailed Laura and asked her about this....I think we would all like to know!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Keep you posted!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1844f2c592c333b2f8db9a8d2a95843f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848948\" timestamp=\"1399560391\"]\nHey Polly,\n \nI emailed her and asked if we would have to pay the vendor fee for make up and hair....let&#039;s see what she says - keep you posted!\n \nHey Bridetobe771!\n \nI emailed Laura and asked her about this....I think we would all like to know!\n \nKeep you posted![\/quote]\n\nI&#039;m just going to go out on a limb here and assume there is a charge for both. I don&#039;t think there is anything they don&#039;t charge extra for :(\n\nAs far a photography goes I took your advice and emailed a few photographers that I like (checked out their websites before hand) They have all replied VERY quickly. Just a few options for those who are looking, I found all these photographers on FaceBook\n\nDean Clarke\nStacey Clarke\nMerrick Cousley\nBrian Nejedly\nJamaica Wedding Photos\n\nOh and you were right about the vendor fees. Most of them cover up to $350 of it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848960,"PostDate":1399565731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 08 May 2014 - 07:46 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hey Polly,<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI emailed her and asked if we would have to pay the vendor fee for make up and hair....let's see what she says - keep you posted!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHey Bridetobe771!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI emailed Laura and asked her about this....I think we would all like to know!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nKeep you posted!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br><br>\nI'm just going to go out on a limb here and assume there is a charge for both. I don't think there is anything they don't charge extra for <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br>\nAs far a photography goes I took your advice and emailed a few photographers that I like (checked out their websites before hand) They have all replied VERY quickly. Just a few options for those who are looking, I found all these photographers on FaceBook<br><br>\nDean Clarke<br>\nStacey Clarke<br>\nMerrick Cousley<br>\nBrian Nejedly<br>\nJamaica Wedding Photos<br><br>\nOh and you were right about the vendor fees. Most of them cover up to $350 of it! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60a4bf975f80f8d3a2118fc4d4ea3e46","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848960\" timestamp=\"1399562131\"]\nI&#039;m just going to go out on a limb here and assume there is a charge for both. I don&#039;t think there is anything they don&#039;t charge extra for :(\n\nAs far a photography goes I took your advice and emailed a few photographers that I like (checked out their websites before hand) They have all replied VERY quickly. Just a few options for those who are looking, I found all these photographers on FaceBook\n\nDean Clarke\nStacey Clarke\nMerrick Cousley\nBrian Nejedly\nJamaica Wedding Photos\n\nOh and you were right about the vendor fees. Most of them cover up to $350 of it![\/quote]\nThat&#039;s great Bridetobe771!\n\nWho do you like best so far?\n\nGood luck deciding! &amp;lt;3 :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1848982,"PostDate":1399569783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 08 May 2014 - 08:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm just going to go out on a limb here and assume there is a charge for both. I don't think there is anything they don't charge extra for <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br>\nAs far a photography goes I took your advice and emailed a few photographers that I like (checked out their websites before hand) They have all replied VERY quickly. Just a few options for those who are looking, I found all these photographers on FaceBook<br><br>\nDean Clarke<br>\nStacey Clarke<br>\nMerrick Cousley<br>\nBrian Nejedly<br>\nJamaica Wedding Photos<br><br>\nOh and you were right about the vendor fees. Most of them cover up to $350 of it!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's great Bridetobe771!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Who do you like best so far?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck deciding! <3 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2850892d465a61efa85c5989c210f65b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848982\" timestamp=\"1399566183\"]\nThat&#039;s great Bridetobe771!\n \nWho do you like best so far?\n \nGood luck deciding! &amp;lt;3 :)[\/quote]Dean Clarke by far. His work is beautiful! I haven&#039;t seen one picture I didn&#039;t like... Oh I hope he is within budget... But if he doesn&#039;t cover the vendor fee that will be a tough one for me. He hasn&#039;t sent me his rates yet. \n\nWho are you leaning towards?","Attachments":[],"Id":1848988,"PostDate":1399570501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 08 May 2014 - 09:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>That's great Bridetobe771!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWho do you like best so far?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nGood luck deciding! <3 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDean Clarke by far. His work is beautiful! I haven't seen one picture I didn't like... Oh I hope he is within budget... But if he doesn't cover the vendor fee that will be a tough one for me. He hasn't sent me his rates yet. <br><br>\nWho are you leaning towards?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42ec684df6919aeef4c8713b0ab83386","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848988\" timestamp=\"1399566901\"]\nDean Clarke by far. His work is beautiful! I haven&#039;t seen one picture I didn&#039;t like... Oh I hope he is within budget... But if he doesn&#039;t cover the vendor fee that will be a tough one for me. He hasn&#039;t sent me his rates yet.\n\nWho are you leaning towards?[\/quote]\nI agree!!!!!\n\nBUT I only heard about him a couple of days ago and when I emailed him he advised he&#039;s booked on my day! :(\n\nDon&#039;t blame him! We are 6 months away! I really have to start locking down vendors!\n\nThis year alone, my Fi and I have purchased a home, I started a new and demanding job, I had to learn to cook LOL or my future hubby would starve! LOL Learn to clean, etc....LOL!!\n\nFYI, I never lived on my own (came from my family home) AND I never lived with a boyfriend or anything LOL so it&#039;s a whole new experience!\n\nThey say don&#039;t have a baby the same year you&#039;re getting married BUT they should also tell you don&#039;t buy a house the same year you&#039;re getting married! There&#039;s just so much to do all the time!\n\nI really like Merrick Cousley but I&#039;m waiting to hear from him because of my date change - hope to hear back soon!\n\nI&#039;m also looking at Dwayne Watkins....waiting to hear from him too!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849001,"PostDate":1399571748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 08 May 2014 - 09:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Dean Clarke by far. His work is beautiful! I haven't seen one picture I didn't like... Oh I hope he is within budget... But if he doesn't cover the vendor fee that will be a tough one for me. He hasn't sent me his rates yet.<br><br>\nWho are you leaning towards?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree!!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>BUT I only heard about him a couple of days ago and when I emailed him he advised he's booked on my day! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Don't blame him! We are 6 months away! I really have to start locking down vendors!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This year alone, my Fi and I have purchased a home, I started a new and demanding job, I had to learn to cook LOL or my future hubby would starve! LOL Learn to clean, etc....LOL!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>FYI, I never lived on my own (came from my family home) AND I never lived with a boyfriend or anything LOL so it's a whole new experience!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They say don't have a baby the same year you're getting married BUT they should also tell you don't buy a house the same year you're getting married! There's just so much to do all the time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really like Merrick Cousley but I'm waiting to hear from him because of my date change - hope to hear back soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also looking at Dwayne Watkins....waiting to hear from him too!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"130.154.0.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41e63708792b3067ff2d889d09b20adf","RawContent":"@[member=\"Bridetobe771\"], unfortunately Dean Clarke doesn&#039;t cover the vendor fee, but his rate is below.\n[quote name=\"CherJK\" post=\"1848670\" timestamp=\"1399484827\"][list]\n[*][b]Dean Clarke Photography[\/b]: All packages include full wedding coverage with 2 photographers. At least 300 pictures for $2600; 500-600 pictures + some prints for $3100; At least 800 pictures + some prints + photo book for $3600; TTD session is $500 additional to any package\n[\/list][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1849069,"PostDate":1399593873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277857\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277857-bridetobe771\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bridetobe771<\/span><\/a>, unfortunately Dean Clarke doesn't cover the vendor fee, but his rate is below.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>CherJK, on 07 May 2014 - 10:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<ul><li><strong>Dean Clarke Photography<\/strong>: All packages include full wedding coverage with 2 photographers. At least 300 pictures for $2600; 500-600 pictures + some prints for $3100; At least 800 pictures + some prints + photo book for $3600; TTD session is $500 additional to any package<\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cherylk1234@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.184.186.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396148555,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CherJK","Id":277400,"Name":"CherJK","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":358,"TotalPages":36,