Photography from another bride on here - have any of you ladies heard of them?\n\n\nGoing to look into them now!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849175,"PostDate":1399651810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just heard about Zuluspro Photography from another bride on here - have any of you ladies heard of them?<br><br>\nGoing to look into them now!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf8fc4f606c60fc9d6f3807ce5aaa7b3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1849175\" timestamp=\"1399648210\"]\nI just heard about Zuluspro Photography from another bride on here - have any of you ladies heard of them?\nGoing to look into them now![\/quote]First time I hear of them pamelas21! Have you received quotes from them?\n\nOn a very exciting note, I have confirmed our wedding date! January 10th, 2015!! Very excited, but also having major anxiety. I haven&#039;t even sent out invitations and it&#039;s 8 months away. How long before hand did you girls send out invites? Did you send save the dates too?","Attachments":[],"Id":1849226,"PostDate":1399659666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 09 May 2014 - 08:10 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I just heard about Zuluspro Photography from another bride on here - have any of you ladies heard of them?<br>\nGoing to look into them now!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nFirst time I hear of them pamelas21! Have you received quotes from them?<br><br>\nOn a very exciting note, I have confirmed our wedding date! January 10th, 2015!! Very excited, but also having major anxiety. I haven't even sent out invitations and it's 8 months away. How long before hand did you girls send out invites? Did you send save the dates too?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5662abee2fb2c994e4f3dade776c2a96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;First time for me too! I emailed them this morning - hope I hear back soon! And hope they&#039;re in my price range!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on the date! That&#039;s so exciting! Just breath because I set the date at the Royalton in February so 10 months for me!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In all honestly, I had planned to do STDs but with everything happening in my life, there was just no time! I booked the group rate through Sunwing in February and gave our guests 1 month to put deposits down!&amp;nbsp;So I emailed them through our wedding website on weddingwire! It&#039;s just been so nuts now that it&#039;s way too late!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll make it up with the full invite though in September &amp;lt;3 I plan on including a formal invite and info on the week: welcome cocktail, rehearsal dinner, wedding, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats again! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a very nice link of Zuluspro Photography that a bride on here was kind enough o share with me!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=RegTGyfRzh4#action=share&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=RegTGyfRzh4#action=share&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849232,"PostDate":1399660995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>First time for me too! I emailed them this morning - hope I hear back soon! And hope they're in my price range!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on the date! That's so exciting! Just breath because I set the date at the Royalton in February so 10 months for me!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In all honestly, I had planned to do STDs but with everything happening in my life, there was just no time! I booked the group rate through Sunwing in February and gave our guests 1 month to put deposits down!\u00a0So I emailed them through our wedding website on weddingwire! It's just been so nuts now that it's way too late!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll make it up with the full invite though in September <3 I plan on including a formal invite and info on the week: welcome cocktail, rehearsal dinner, wedding, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats again! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<br \/><p>Here's a very nice link of Zuluspro Photography that a bride on here was kind enough o share with me!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=RegTGyfRzh4#action=share' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.youtube.c...h4#action=share<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f712ab82d4f6d3599231a0ea3a015377","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a busy bee let me tell you all! LOL&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ok I have an update from Laura!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;See questions and her answers below in red:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; If I wanted to bring in a makeup artist and hair stylist for during the day to do my hair and makeup would I have to pay the vendor fee or can I pay a day pass? How much is the day pass? &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;As long as they are doing this in your room, we can charge a day pass per person. $70 USD per person.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;\u00b7&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Do you charge a fee to set up d\u00e9cor we bring from home? &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;Generally not \u2013 this is something that we love to do for our clients! However, it would depend on what exactly you are bringing, as if it involves different departments, we might need a fee. It would never be more than $250 USD.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And!!! She also sent me a 90 page PDF of flower, d\u00e9cor, etc options!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I took the liberty of emailing it to most of you but I\u2019m sure I missed some of you! Sorry!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Shoot me a message with your email address and I\u2019ll forward it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019ll also post it here \u2013 damn I need to reach 150 posts soon! Feels like it\u2019s taking forever!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-------------------------------&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And I got quotes from Zuluspro Photography! He\u2019s available on my day! YAY! I need to decide THIS weekend on a photographer!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;He&#039;s honestly affordable compared to other photographers:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;$2,000&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Unlimited (full coverage)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One photographer&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;B\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Online Gallery&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DVD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;$3,700&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Unlimited (full coverage)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Two photographer&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;B\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Online Gallery&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DVD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DVD slide show with music&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5 - 8x10 printed photos&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;He&#039;s got a 3rd package but it&#039;s over $9,000 LOL&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-------------------------------&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And I think I&#039;m booking Loni Jones for makeup! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849311,"PostDate":1399670021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm a busy bee let me tell you all! LOL<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ok I have an update from Laura!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>See questions and her answers below in red:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7<\/span>\u00a0 If I wanted to bring in a makeup artist and hair stylist for during the day to do my hair and makeup would I have to pay the vendor fee or can I pay a day pass? How much is the day pass? <span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">As long as they are doing this in your room, we can charge a day pass per person. $70 USD per person.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7<\/span>\u00a0 Do you charge a fee to set up d\u00e9cor we bring from home? <span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Generally not \u2013 this is something that we love to do for our clients! However, it would depend on what exactly you are bringing, as if it involves different departments, we might need a fee. It would never be more than $250 USD.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And!!! She also sent me a 90 page PDF of flower, d\u00e9cor, etc options!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I took the liberty of emailing it to most of you but I\u2019m sure I missed some of you! Sorry!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Shoot me a message with your email address and I\u2019ll forward it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019ll also post it here \u2013 damn I need to reach 150 posts soon! Feels like it\u2019s taking forever!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-------------------------------<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And I got quotes from Zuluspro Photography! He\u2019s available on my day! YAY! I need to decide THIS weekend on a photographer!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>He's honestly affordable compared to other photographers:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>$2,000<\/p>\n<p>Unlimited (full coverage)<\/p>\n<p>One photographer<\/p>\n<p>B\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal<\/p>\n<p>Online Gallery<\/p>\n<p>DVD<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>$3,700<\/p>\n<p>Unlimited (full coverage)<\/p>\n<p>Two photographer<\/p>\n<p>B\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal<\/p>\n<p>Online Gallery<\/p>\n<p>DVD<\/p>\n<p>DVD slide show with music<\/p>\n<p>5 - 8x10 printed photos<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>He's got a 3rd package but it's over $9,000 LOL<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-------------------------------<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And I think I'm booking Loni Jones for makeup! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b566a671c1802694cb2c12432455c3b","RawContent":"Wow thanks for all the information pamelas21! And thank you for the email :) \n\n$9000 photography package?! Wowzers do they follow you around for the whole week for that price? Lol!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849317,"PostDate":1399672710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow thanks for all the information pamelas21! And thank you for the email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br>\n$9000 photography package?! Wowzers do they follow you around for the whole week for that price? Lol!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"137565ca28a5667cd70647b9e140ba55","RawContent":"I know! Lol for $9k that&#039;s what I would expect!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849319,"PostDate":1399673388,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know! Lol for $9k that's what I would expect! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.24.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b844881ceed1cb1c43965b014fe1ee8","RawContent":"Bahahahaha $9,000. I&#039;d have to win lotto max and they&#039;d have follow us around for the entire stay. And do my engagement photos and ..... Lol. I&#039;m being ridiculous, but $9,000 is crazy\n150 posts. Does that include replies?","Attachments":[],"Id":1849355,"PostDate":1399689664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Bahahahaha $9,000. I'd have to win lotto max and they'd have follow us around for the entire stay. And do my engagement photos and ..... Lol. I'm being ridiculous, but $9,000 is crazy<br \/>150 posts. Does that include replies?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>This dress is for sale by the way","Email":"dimps4dyz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.4.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394161195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277037.jpg?_r=1435766133","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dimps","Id":277037,"Name":"Dimps","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.197.182.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9a5da3b8562aa9798a0c27ba8bc4e51","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1849311\" timestamp=\"1399666421\"]\nHi ladies!!!\n \nI&#039;m a busy bee let me tell you all! LOL\n \nOk I have an update from Laura!\n \nSee questions and her answers below in red:\n \n[font=symbol]\u00b7[\/font]  If I wanted to bring in a makeup artist and hair stylist for during the day to do my hair and makeup would I have to pay the vendor fee or can I pay a day pass? How much is the day pass? [color=#ff0000]As long as they are doing this in your room, we can charge a day pass per person. $70 USD per person.[\/color]\n \n[font=symbol]\u00b7[\/font]  Do you charge a fee to set up d\u00e9cor we bring from home? [color=#ff0000]Generally not \u2013 this is something that we love to do for our clients! However, it would depend on what exactly you are bringing, as if it involves different departments, we might need a fee. It would never be more than $250 USD.[\/color]\n \nAnd!!! She also sent me a 90 page PDF of flower, d\u00e9cor, etc options!\n \nI took the liberty of emailing it to most of you but I\u2019m sure I missed some of you! Sorry!\n \nShoot me a message with your email address and I\u2019ll forward it!\n \nI\u2019ll also post it here \u2013 damn I need to reach 150 posts soon! Feels like it\u2019s taking forever!\n \n&amp;lt;3\n \n-------------------------------\n \nAnd I got quotes from Zuluspro Photography! He\u2019s available on my day! YAY! I need to decide THIS weekend on a photographer!\n \nHe&#039;s honestly affordable compared to other photographers:\n \n$2,000\nUnlimited (full coverage)\nOne photographer\nB\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal\nOnline Gallery\nDVD\n \n$3,700\nUnlimited (full coverage)\nTwo photographer\nB\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal\nOnline Gallery\nDVD\nDVD slide show with music\n5 - 8x10 printed photos\n \nHe&#039;s got a 3rd package but it&#039;s over $9,000 LOL\n \n-------------------------------\n \nAnd I think I&#039;m booking Loni Jones for makeup! &amp;lt;3[\/quote]Wow, thank you Pam for all the info...and double checking with the make up artist...def saving a little there.\n\nI wonder how much each accessory cost...oh my\nIt will def add up really quickly....","Attachments":[],"Id":1849379,"PostDate":1399695545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 09 May 2014 - 01:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi ladies!!!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI'm a busy bee let me tell you all! LOL<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nOk I have an update from Laura!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSee questions and her answers below in red:<br>\n\u00a0<br><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7<\/span>\u00a0 If I wanted to bring in a makeup artist and hair stylist for during the day to do my hair and makeup would I have to pay the vendor fee or can I pay a day pass? How much is the day pass? <span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">As long as they are doing this in your room, we can charge a day pass per person. $70 USD per person.<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7<\/span>\u00a0 Do you charge a fee to set up d\u00e9cor we bring from home? <span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Generally not \u2013 this is something that we love to do for our clients! However, it would depend on what exactly you are bringing, as if it involves different departments, we might need a fee. It would never be more than $250 USD.<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nAnd!!! She also sent me a 90 page PDF of flower, d\u00e9cor, etc options!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI took the liberty of emailing it to most of you but I\u2019m sure I missed some of you! Sorry!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nShoot me a message with your email address and I\u2019ll forward it!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI\u2019ll also post it here \u2013 damn I need to reach 150 posts soon! Feels like it\u2019s taking forever!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n<3<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n-------------------------------<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nAnd I got quotes from Zuluspro Photography! He\u2019s available on my day! YAY! I need to decide THIS weekend on a photographer!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHe's honestly affordable compared to other photographers:<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n$2,000<br>\nUnlimited (full coverage)<br>\nOne photographer<br>\nB\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal<br>\nOnline Gallery<br>\nDVD<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n$3,700<br>\nUnlimited (full coverage)<br>\nTwo photographer<br>\nB\/W, Sepia, Blemish Removal<br>\nOnline Gallery<br>\nDVD<br>\nDVD slide show with music<br>\n5 - 8x10 printed photos<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHe's got a 3rd package but it's over $9,000 LOL<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n-------------------------------<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nAnd I think I'm booking Loni Jones for makeup! <3<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWow, thank you Pam for all the info...and double checking with the make up artist...def saving a little there.<br><br>\nI wonder how much each accessory cost...oh my<br>\nIt will def add up really quickly....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pollyt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.197.185.168","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1390377255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dec2014star","Id":276258,"Name":"dec2014star","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d38292570e7887af48762dae8a540e93","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Np at all! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anywhere we can save money! lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849391,"PostDate":1399727200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Np at all! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anywhere we can save money! lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":358,"TotalPages":36,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
