{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.226.129.109","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"722bed5bf2902996a7896b74cdd2ff47","RawContent":"Thanks for the email Pam! $1478 for 7 nights sounds amazing! I have to do more research. Is Sunwing a wedding planning site\/company or just for regular travel?","Attachments":[],"Id":1850876,"PostDate":1400341839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the email Pam! $1478 for 7 nights sounds amazing! I have to do more research. Is Sunwing a wedding planning site\/company or just for regular travel? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.236.233.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398959437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SoEze","Id":277799,"Name":"SoEze","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fed2c7e5b1791a4b25e91a4461b55d76","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;No prob!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sunwing is a Canadian airline and tour operator...they actually own Royalton White Sands. I think it&#039;s the first hotel they own....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would definitely get quotes from many different providers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850879,"PostDate":1400342404,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>No prob!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sunwing is a Canadian airline and tour operator...they actually own Royalton White Sands. I think it's the first hotel they own....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would definitely get quotes from many different providers!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14c4dec0acc9f3185902fcd725b74d79","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1850862\" timestamp=\"1400332414\"]\nNo worries! I&#039;ll be posting anything and everything I think you ladies might find useful over the next few months! ;)\n \nCongrats on sending out your invites! That&#039;s awesome! I&#039;m sure your guests are super excited to book the vacation!\n \nI&#039;m having a hard time with picking a photographer as well....I keep saying &#039;ok, this one&#039; but then 10 minutes later I&#039;m like &#039;wait, am I sure?&#039; LOL It honestly is one of the biggest decisions! Are you leaning towards Merrick? Sorry about his prices :(\n \nWhen are you going dress shopping? YAY have fun! &amp;lt;3 I just went on May 3rd and purchased the first dress I tried on &amp;lt;3\n \nHey CherJK! :) Do you know if we can add it to the Free Package? It says location to be determined in location - does that mean they can&#039;t guarantee the location we want? Like the beach or the pool? Do you know what the traditional Jamaican dinner includes?\n \nSorry for all the questions!\n \nThanks for the photographer suggestion - do you know what photographer you&#039;re going with?[\/quote]Hi Pamelas21. Yes you can add the Jamaican Experience to the free wedding package. That&#039;s what we will be doing it really does seem like the most cost effective way of having a wedding. But I do agree with CherJK, the food choices are no surf and turf. Here are the choices\n\nApps\n\nBeef patties\nJamaican jerk sausages\nCodfish &amp;amp; Ackee canap\u00e9s\n\nDinner Menu\n\nSalad-garden salad\nSoup-pumpkin soup\n\nMain course\n\nJerk Chicken\ncurried goat\nEscovitched Fish (??? No idea what this is)\n\nPlain Rice \/ rice and peas\nRice Plantains\nSweet Potatoes\n\nDessert\n\nCoconut Pudding \/ assorted seasonal fruits\nBanana Mousse\n\nI think the menu is the biggest downfall of this package. I also asked if there was an additional setup fee for the package and her response was. With the Jamaica experience we can host this event for you at the beach or poolside. 20 guests are included within the package - additional guests are $50usd per person to include them within this package. \n\nAlso with the jamaican experience there is no location fee - it is all included within the package price. It is highly recommended should you wish to host a private reception. \n\nI&#039;m not positive but it would be worth looking into the possibility of changing the menu to suit your needs. I&#039;m sure they would charge extra though...\n[quote name=\"SoEze\" post=\"1850866\" timestamp=\"1400332682\"]\nGood morning Brides!!! \nMy wedding is next June so I&#039;m going to my first bridal gown shop in June 21st. Yay!!! I have a dress or two in mind but we&#039;ll see what the outcome is once I get there:-). \nJust out of curiosity, what are the expected cost for you guest to attend and how long are you asking them to stay? I&#039;m trying to keep their cost for hotel and flight around $1200 for 5 days\/4nights from JFK. Of course no one has to stay for 5 days though \nPam, do you mind emailing me that packet that you have? Soewedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com \nThanks![\/quote]We have rates of $1748 per person for 7 nights (from Toronto). Your rates are going to vary greatly depending on which month you are travelling. January-March is going to be the most expensive time to travel. It usually gets less expensive during the summer months.","Attachments":[],"Id":1850886,"PostDate":1400348332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 17 May 2014 - 06:13 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>No worries! I'll be posting anything and everything I think you ladies might find useful over the next few months! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nCongrats on sending out your invites! That's awesome! I'm sure your guests are super excited to book the vacation!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI'm having a hard time with picking a photographer as well....I keep saying 'ok, this one' but then 10 minutes later I'm like 'wait, am I sure?' LOL It honestly is one of the biggest decisions! Are you leaning towards Merrick? Sorry about his prices <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWhen are you going dress shopping? YAY have fun! <3 I just went on May 3rd and purchased the first dress I tried on <3<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHey CherJK! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Do you know if we can add it to the Free Package? It says location to be determined in location - does that mean they can't guarantee the location we want? Like the beach or the pool? Do you know what the traditional Jamaican dinner includes?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSorry for all the questions!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThanks for the photographer suggestion - do you know what photographer you're going with?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi Pamelas21. Yes you can add the Jamaican Experience to the free wedding package. That's what we will be doing it really does seem like the most cost effective way of having a wedding. But I do agree with CherJK, the food choices are no surf and turf. Here are the choices<br><br>\nApps<br><br>\nBeef patties<br>\nJamaican jerk sausages<br>\nCodfish & Ackee canap\u00e9s<br><br>\nDinner Menu<br><br>\nSalad-garden salad<br>\nSoup-pumpkin soup<br><br>\nMain course<br><br>\nJerk Chicken<br>\ncurried goat<br>\nEscovitched Fish (??? No idea what this is)<br><br>\nPlain Rice \/ rice and peas<br>\nRice Plantains<br>\nSweet Potatoes<br><br>\nDessert<br><br>\nCoconut Pudding \/ assorted seasonal fruits<br>\nBanana Mousse<br><br>\nI think the menu is the biggest downfall of this package. I also asked if there was an additional setup fee for the package and her response was. With the Jamaica experience we can host this event for you at the beach or poolside. 20 guests are included within the package - additional guests are $50usd per person to include them within this package. <br><br>\nAlso with the jamaican experience there is no location fee - it is all included within the package price. It is highly recommended should you wish to host a private reception. <br><br>\nI'm not positive but it would be worth looking into the possibility of changing the menu to suit your needs. I'm sure they would charge extra though...<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SoEze, on 17 May 2014 - 06:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Good morning Brides!!! <br>\nMy wedding is next June so I'm going to my first bridal gown shop in June 21st. Yay!!! I have a dress or two in mind but we'll see what the outcome is once I get there:-). <br>\nJust out of curiosity, what are the expected cost for you guest to attend and how long are you asking them to stay? I'm trying to keep their cost for hotel and flight around $1200 for 5 days\/4nights from JFK. Of course no one has to stay for 5 days though <br>\nPam, do you mind emailing me that packet that you have? Soewedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com <br>\nThanks!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe have rates of $1748 per person for 7 nights (from Toronto). Your rates are going to vary greatly depending on which month you are travelling. January-March is going to be the most expensive time to travel. It usually gets less expensive during the summer months. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a78bb5e7e49fe75d25ba3b205b583350","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing bridetobe771! It honestly is an awesome deal with the steel drum band and reggae band included!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850899,"PostDate":1400356834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing bridetobe771! It honestly is an awesome deal with the steel drum band and reggae band included!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf3f3cad0cf288874e4315c93b3d9a6f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies! This is my 150th post! Hooray! lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851203,"PostDate":1400525839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies! This is my 150th post! Hooray! lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"152eb75bef99571830b2c08b3bdd9411","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The nickel and diming makes me a bit nervous, we\u2019re already over budget! Then again, you only get married once. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have Laura\u2019s contact info?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852340,"PostDate":1401289992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The nickel and diming makes me a bit nervous, we\u2019re already over budget! Then again, you only get married once. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have Laura\u2019s contact info?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389147080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bc6edc49524dae3c02cc5858baaff63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I contact Laura through this email address: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com&#039;&gt;weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We\u2019re over budget too!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Honestly, I have to say I\u2019m a little frustrated! If I\u2019d known this wedding was going to cost this much I would\u2019ve waited another year to save! And to top it all off we have to pay in USD not CDN which makes a difference for us Canadian couples!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I apologize in advance for the below rant\u2026..&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=\"font-family:wingdings;\"&gt;:(&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Note ladies \u2013 WE HAVE TO USE TAI FLORA!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The reviews on here for Tai Flora ARE NOT GREAT!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And to top that I just got the flower quote! IT\u201dS CRAZY! $600 for medium rose coverage for the wedding aisle. WHAT?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I happened to come across Jan\u2019s Flowers Catalog because I was looking for a cake vendor \u2013 wish I hadn\u2019t because Jan\u2019s flowers prices are so much cheaper!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got a quote for a small vase of roses and hydrangeas \u2013 small for the cocktail tables - $80 with Tai Flora.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In Jan\u2019s Flowers Catalog, the exact same arrangement is $30\u2026..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jan\u2019s Flowers Chiavari chairs are $7 each \u2013 Tai Flora is $10 each!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Chuppah with white draping in Jan\u2019s flowers $250 \u2013 Tai Flora is $466!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gah!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I\u2019m just so sad I HAVE to use her! Especially since the reviews on here are SO BAD for Tai Flora!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tai Flora quoted me $200 for my bridal bouquet \u2013 my lord I honestly didn\u2019t think it would be that much ESPECIALLY SINCE MY BOUQUET IS INCLUDED WITH MY WEDDING PACKAGE! I mean they\u2019re charging what a florist in Canada would charge for flowers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I emailed Laura a LONG email yesterday requesting more quotes\u2026.I told her Jan\u2019s flowers has a full catalog with prices and that it would be so much easier if Tai Flora had prices in her catalog too!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also looked up tropical flowers in hopes that I can bring this cost down\u2026you ladies should see this email I sent Laura \u2013 it\u2019s massive! But I told her I can\u2019t make a decision without pricing!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I mean, shouldn\u2019t they help us!? I asked Laura to ask the florist to give me suggestions on flowers to bring the cost down!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry for all the caps ladies \u2013 I\u2019m just shocked and confused! Feel like the Royalton is making a BIG cut of this wedding \u2013 Tai Flora better be worth it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry again for the caps and frustration! I can\u2019t even stress how jailed I feel that we have to use Tai Flora!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pam&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852350,"PostDate":1401292452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I contact Laura through this email address: <a href='mailto:weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We\u2019re over budget too!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Honestly, I have to say I\u2019m a little frustrated! If I\u2019d known this wedding was going to cost this much I would\u2019ve waited another year to save! And to top it all off we have to pay in USD not CDN which makes a difference for us Canadian couples!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I apologize in advance for the below rant\u2026..\u00a0 <span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Note ladies \u2013 WE HAVE TO USE TAI FLORA!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The reviews on here for Tai Flora ARE NOT GREAT!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And to top that I just got the flower quote! IT\u201dS CRAZY! $600 for medium rose coverage for the wedding aisle. WHAT?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I happened to come across Jan\u2019s Flowers Catalog because I was looking for a cake vendor \u2013 wish I hadn\u2019t because Jan\u2019s flowers prices are so much cheaper!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got a quote for a small vase of roses and hydrangeas \u2013 small for the cocktail tables - $80 with Tai Flora.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In Jan\u2019s Flowers Catalog, the exact same arrangement is $30\u2026..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jan\u2019s Flowers Chiavari chairs are $7 each \u2013 Tai Flora is $10 each!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Chuppah with white draping in Jan\u2019s flowers $250 \u2013 Tai Flora is $466!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gah!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I\u2019m just so sad I HAVE to use her! Especially since the reviews on here are SO BAD for Tai Flora!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tai Flora quoted me $200 for my bridal bouquet \u2013 my lord I honestly didn\u2019t think it would be that much ESPECIALLY SINCE MY BOUQUET IS INCLUDED WITH MY WEDDING PACKAGE! I mean they\u2019re charging what a florist in Canada would charge for flowers!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I emailed Laura a LONG email yesterday requesting more quotes\u2026.I told her Jan\u2019s flowers has a full catalog with prices and that it would be so much easier if Tai Flora had prices in her catalog too!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also looked up tropical flowers in hopes that I can bring this cost down\u2026you ladies should see this email I sent Laura \u2013 it\u2019s massive! But I told her I can\u2019t make a decision without pricing!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I mean, shouldn\u2019t they help us!? I asked Laura to ask the florist to give me suggestions on flowers to bring the cost down!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry for all the caps ladies \u2013 I\u2019m just shocked and confused! Feel like the Royalton is making a BIG cut of this wedding \u2013 Tai Flora better be worth it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry again for the caps and frustration! I can\u2019t even stress how jailed I feel that we have to use Tai Flora!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.24.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62a983002b9e60b465578e6bf5df82f9","RawContent":"Rant all you want Pam. Once you get it out it may make you feel a little better. #wearehereforyou\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1852357,"PostDate":1401293973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Rant all you want Pam. Once you get it out it may make you feel a little better. #wearehereforyou<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>This dress is for sale by the way","Email":"dimps4dyz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.4.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394161195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277037.jpg?_r=1435766133","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dimps","Id":277037,"Name":"Dimps","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f67da262e40900100b103e04330f2bea","RawContent":"I agree! Rant away! That&#039;s what this thread is for, helping and ranting lol! :) I&#039;m sure when I get closer to my wedding date I will have lots of \"rant\" posts too. \nWhy do have to use Tai flora? If you pay the vendor fee why couldn&#039;t you use someone else? I asked about bringing in a makeup artist and was told I&#039;d have to pay the $450 vendor fee to bring them in HAHA! That&#039;s not going to happen!","Attachments":[],"Id":1852362,"PostDate":1401295213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree! Rant away! That's what this thread is for, helping and ranting lol! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm sure when I get closer to my wedding date I will have lots of \"rant\" posts too. <br \/>Why do have to use Tai flora? If you pay the vendor fee why couldn't you use someone else? I asked about bringing in a makeup artist and was told I'd have to pay the $450 vendor fee to bring them in HAHA! That's not going to happen!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ca5f7cd1843fcc560493d4d171511f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks ladies! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The contract says: Unfortunately, we do not allow any other wedding provider companies or vendors aside from photographers or videographers at this time.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Laura told me I can bring in my own hair and make up as long as they do it in my room for $70 each. It&#039;s called the day pass....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This better be correct because I already put down deposits for Loni Jones and Hair by Chellz!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Who told you $450? Laura?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852367,"PostDate":1401295665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks ladies! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The contract says: Unfortunately, we do not allow any other wedding provider companies or vendors aside from photographers or videographers at this time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Laura told me I can bring in my own hair and make up as long as they do it in my room for $70 each. It's called the day pass....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This better be correct because I already put down deposits for Loni Jones and Hair by Chellz!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Who told you $450? Laura?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":358,"TotalPages":36,"CurrentPage":120,"NextPage":130,"PreviousPage":110,"LastPage":350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
