> User Toyal (284663)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.197.184.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa1b63d1be566dbd64587b8210f60023","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Girls..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pam: I agree with all the other girls... rant away we are here to listen.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So this is what I did so far after reading all the threads&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Originally I signed on for the Dream package but realizing it is not what we wanted and thanx to this thread.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We were able to switch to the free package and Jamaica Experience. (super excited)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So if you have 50 guest?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;10ppl free then $20 x 40 = 800&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jamaica includes 20ppl then $50 x 30 = 1500 + 2800(for the package price)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So this is what we are going with....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But never realized we have to PAY for our bridal bouquet.... I though in the package it is included? I never inquired about the decor yet.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We chose the beach gazebo.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was told in the email that it comes with this white linen and small table and flower centre piece so I don&#039;t think we will add much to it... keeping it simple.... (but we haven&#039;t looked into it yet =) )&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The dinner portion as someone already mentioned&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We can have it on the beach (at no extra cost...for this location fee of 300dollars or something like that)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you guys thought about bringing your centre pieces?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So I was told by Laura: each table includes white linen and napkin and \"a few tea lights\"&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was thinking we have max 5 tables or so?&amp;nbsp;Have your family bring the vase you are going to use and add your personal touch (sand is everywhere) and some silk flowers if you like flowers??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Polly&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852524,"PostDate":1401372619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Girls..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam: I agree with all the other girls... rant away we are here to listen.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So this is what I did so far after reading all the threads<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Originally I signed on for the Dream package but realizing it is not what we wanted and thanx to this thread.<\/p>\n<p>We were able to switch to the free package and Jamaica Experience. (super excited)<\/p>\n<p>So if you have 50 guest?<\/p>\n<p>10ppl free then $20 x 40 = 800<\/p>\n<p>Jamaica includes 20ppl then $50 x 30 = 1500 + 2800(for the package price)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So this is what we are going with....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But never realized we have to PAY for our bridal bouquet.... I though in the package it is included? I never inquired about the decor yet.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We chose the beach gazebo.<\/p>\n<p>I was told in the email that it comes with this white linen and small table and flower centre piece so I don't think we will add much to it... keeping it simple.... (but we haven't looked into it yet =) )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The dinner portion as someone already mentioned<\/p>\n<p>We can have it on the beach (at no extra cost...for this location fee of 300dollars or something like that)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you guys thought about bringing your centre pieces?<\/p>\n<p>So I was told by Laura: each table includes white linen and napkin and \"a few tea lights\"<\/p>\n<p>I was thinking we have max 5 tables or so?\u00a0Have your family bring the vase you are going to use and add your personal touch (sand is everywhere) and some silk flowers if you like flowers??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Polly<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pollyt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.197.185.168","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1390377255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dec2014star","Id":276258,"Name":"dec2014star","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.1.132.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9175dd70e2ea0f15d488740000171eb7","RawContent":"Hi I&#039;m new to this forum but have just booked my wedding at the royalton white sands for April 2015 :) would love to hear from you all about your weddings and would be really grateful if you have and photos or information about weddings here :) x","Attachments":[],"Id":1852948,"PostDate":1401522758,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi I'm new to this forum but have just booked my wedding at the royalton white sands for April 2015 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> would love to hear from you all about your weddings and would be really grateful if you have and photos or information about weddings here <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"paula-1984@live.co.uk","IpAddress":"94.1.132.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401479892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278172.jpg?_r=1421157464","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"paulah1984","Id":278172,"Name":"paulah1984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.178.226.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cb2583c863880bfe88a7cb61ecb7f44","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Pam,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Could you please email me the info as well? ashleystaggs@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853032,"PostDate":1401580637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Pam,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Could you please email me the info as well? ashleystaggs@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleystaggs@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.178.226.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401580419,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"arobb984","Id":278182,"Name":"arobb984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.207.78.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1b05ede6bb8aa7db36f40eb70d58383","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848406\" timestamp=\"1399385801\"]\nI&#039;m from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!\n\nWe have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!\n\nSo excited for you! How many people are you expecting?\n\nPam[\/quote]Hello Toronto\/Markham people.\n\nJust wondering did you go through a travel agent or sunwing directly??\n\nSharon","Attachments":[],"Id":1853542,"PostDate":1401810284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 06 May 2014 - 07:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm from Markham but I just bought a house with my fiance in Brampton!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have 51 guests booked in with deposits with Sunwing for November 2014!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited for you! How many people are you expecting?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello Toronto\/Markham people.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wondering did you go through a travel agent or sunwing directly??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sharon<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"s284lee@ryerson.ca","IpAddress":"205.207.78.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401809979,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278222.jpg?oh=aa0ee778430686f84d97c13681c05b71&oe=54644ce9&__gda__=1415361067_6c1e82461574b1a6011ccc8b0238929f","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":279,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Shar3L","Id":278222,"Name":"Shar3L","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.173.224.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e60500aa4bd8ef67d2ec50455d5d5426","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone...i am getting married at the Royalton on july 3, 2014...Pamela has been great with tips...im super excited...its only going to be the two of us though&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854057,"PostDate":1401990069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone...i am getting married at the Royalton on july 3, 2014...Pamela has been great with tips...im super excited...its only going to be the two of us though<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shari124@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.173.224.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399402390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277863.jpg?_r=1399406079","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":279,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saj8380","Id":277863,"Name":"saj8380","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.41.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d3e458d9b5d65c46ec9efe881d5d184","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Pam&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am also hoping to book Royalton White Sands for my wedding- hoping to get a date February 2015. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can you send me the pdf to happywedding2015@[member=\"gmail\"].com please?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for all the useful information. I am so happy I found this post!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Theresa&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854324,"PostDate":1402256263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Pam<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am also hoping to book Royalton White Sands for my wedding- hoping to get a date February 2015. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can you send me the pdf to happywedding2015@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com please?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for all the useful information. I am so happy I found this post!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Theresa<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"happywedding2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.0.41.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402255826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"happywedding2015","Id":278321,"Name":"happywedding2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b67a91b052b7d0d99f651590891300ec","RawContent":"How is everyone doing with their planning? I&#039;m now 7 months away!! I feel like it have soooo much to do. \n[quote name=\"Shar3L\" post=\"1853542\" timestamp=\"1401806684\"]\nHello Toronto\/Markham people.\n \nJust wondering did you go through a travel agent or sunwing directly??\n \nSharon[\/quote]I booked directly through Sunwing. I received pricing from a few travel agents and they were all coming back with the same price as Sunwing or higher. Finally just settled on going directly with Sunwing. The only thing I don&#039;t like about Them is they don&#039;t act as a traditional travel agent, what I mean by that is the bride and groom are responsible for collecting names and CC information from the guests. Guests are asked not to contact Sunwing directly. I didn&#039;t realize this until it was too late... Wishing I had gone through a travel agent :( I really don&#039;t need all the extra stress of getting everyone&#039;s info.","Attachments":[],"Id":1854840,"PostDate":1402537506,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                How is everyone doing with their planning? I'm now 7 months away!! I feel like it have soooo much to do. <br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Shar3L, on 03 June 2014 - 07:44 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hello Toronto\/Markham people.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nJust wondering did you go through a travel agent or sunwing directly??<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSharon<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI booked directly through Sunwing. I received pricing from a few travel agents and they were all coming back with the same price as Sunwing or higher. Finally just settled on going directly with Sunwing. The only thing I don't like about Them is they don't act as a traditional travel agent, what I mean by that is the bride and groom are responsible for collecting names and CC information from the guests. Guests are asked not to contact Sunwing directly. I didn't realize this until it was too late... Wishing I had gone through a travel agent <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I really don't need all the extra stress of getting everyone's info. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.52.95.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1402701354,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6df77b4c114b28340bd650d560bed2c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies.....I made it back from my mini vacation to Jamaica.&amp;nbsp; I had the chance to stay at the Royalton and met with Chandlyn (wedding manager).&amp;nbsp; Chandlyn is really nice and very helpful with all of my endless questions.&amp;nbsp; During my visit I also went to Secrets and Iberostar.&amp;nbsp; I have to say that Royalton is a much better choice....only downside is the regular rooms are a bit small, which I will let my guests know in advance.&amp;nbsp; The presidential suite and honeymoon suites are very nice!!&amp;nbsp; (We stayed in Presidential).  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have booked our stay for the wedding with my travel agent and we were able to get 8 nights in the Presidential Suite for $2800. (Very nice deal!)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am now working with Ellie to get the wedding booked.&amp;nbsp; We are doing October 10, 2015 at 5 pm.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have posted pics in the photo gallery - Royalton White Sands.&amp;nbsp; I have a lot of pics in there but I tried to put a little of everything in there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There is also a rooftop location that you can use for the ceremony or cocktail hour, the only draw back is it steps (no elevator) and it is very steep to get up there.   That is very beautiful!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope this helps......happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"pamelas21\"].....I have posted the photos in the gallery.&amp;nbsp; It is titled Royalton White Sands.   I included pictures of the conference room so I hope this helps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The conference room is really big.&amp;nbsp; Chandlyn stated they are in the process of getting the room dividers but it was very nice!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tish&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855153,"PostDate":1402701306,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies.....I made it back from my mini vacation to Jamaica.\u00a0 I had the chance to stay at the Royalton and met with Chandlyn (wedding manager).\u00a0 Chandlyn is really nice and very helpful with all of my endless questions.\u00a0 During my visit I also went to Secrets and Iberostar.\u00a0 I have to say that Royalton is a much better choice....only downside is the regular rooms are a bit small, which I will let my guests know in advance.\u00a0 The presidential suite and honeymoon suites are very nice!!\u00a0 (We stayed in Presidential).\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have booked our stay for the wedding with my travel agent and we were able to get 8 nights in the Presidential Suite for $2800. (Very nice deal!)\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am now working with Ellie to get the wedding booked.\u00a0 We are doing October 10, 2015 at 5 pm.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have posted pics in the photo gallery - Royalton White Sands.\u00a0 I have a lot of pics in there but I tried to put a little of everything in there.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There is also a rooftop location that you can use for the ceremony or cocktail hour, the only draw back is it steps (no elevator) and it is very steep to get up there.\u00a0\u00a0 That is very beautiful!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope this helps......happy planning!<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a>.....I have posted the photos in the gallery.\u00a0 It is titled Royalton White Sands.\u00a0\u00a0 I included pictures of the conference room so I hope this helps.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The conference room is really big.\u00a0 Chandlyn stated they are in the process of getting the room dividers but it was very nice!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tish<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397070122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb04e35cfeffeaa3ff15be2ce94bf835","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"FutureMrsGlover\"] Thanks a million for sharing the photos! Looks like such a gorgeous place :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855268,"PostDate":1402792431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277534\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277534-futuremrsglover\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGlover<\/span><\/a> Thanks a million for sharing the photos! Looks like such a gorgeous place <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389147080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.54.52.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e48b1889a0074fdb65f45535c58b8b33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"FutureMrsGlover\"] thanks for the pics!! It makes planning a little easier. I wish that I was able to go to the RWS when I visited last month but we felt that it was a little too far away and we were only down for a couple of days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855744,"PostDate":1403032424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277534\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277534-futuremrsglover\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGlover<\/span><\/a> thanks for the pics!! It makes planning a little easier. I wish that I was able to go to the RWS when I visited last month but we felt that it was a little too far away and we were only down for a couple of days.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k-brown_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.14.40.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398178031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277678.jpg?_r=1403101424","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kail28","Id":277678,"Name":"kail28","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":358,"TotalPages":36,"CurrentPage":140,"NextPage":150,"PreviousPage":130,"LastPage":350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
